【七位女主对话不同字体显示/数值展示/攻略进度展示', '🌸', '#d946ef', 'linear-gradient(135deg, #d946ef 0%, #ec4899 100%)', '{"title": "六份感情契约，妹嫁才是最终答案？【攻略/救赎/后宫/感情/兄妹】", "desc": "六份感情契约，妹嫁才是最终答案？【内置文风】\n\n【七位女主不同性格对话风格/各种性癖和体位姿势待玩家探查】\n\n【七位女主对话不同字体显示/数值展示/攻略进度展示/多条结局路线、隐藏真结局？】\n\n父母双亡的落魄少爷，为了救患有间歇性失明的妹妹，签下了六份合同 —— 给海城六个女人当职业舔狗。\n\n清冷校花、疯批教授、戏曲花旦、傲娇校霸、病娇学姐、温柔姐姐 —— 每个人都带着自己的伤口和算计，每个人都在", "bg_image": "https://aimiha.live/VuGJ3bJd/avatar.jpg"}', '[]', '[]', '{}', '[{"isUser": false, "story": "【序章 · 初临】\n\n六份感情契约，妹嫁才是最终答案？【内置文风】\n\n【七位女主不同性格对话风格/各种性癖和体位姿势待玩家探查】\n\n【七位女主对话不同字体显示/数值展示/攻略进度展示/多条结局路线、隐藏真结局？】\n\n父母双亡的落魄少爷，为了救患有间歇性失明的妹妹，签下了六份合同 —— 给海城六个女人当职业舔狗。\n\n清冷校花、疯批教授、戏曲花旦、傲娇校霸、病娇学姐、温柔姐姐 —— 每个人都带着自己的伤口和算计，每个人都在教你一件事，但你不知道她们在教你什么。\n\n六位客户各自代表\"爱的一种理解方式：\n\n林知夏（保护不是表演）、顾霜（报复不是爱）、苏鸾（陪伴本身就是真心）、安小满（占有不是爱）、叶甜甜（说真话才有人信）、温念安（假装久了会成真）。\n\n一个月多后，六份合同全部到期。你以为自己在赚钱救妹妹。\n\n直到七月中旬那晚，妹妹侧过脸，异色瞳在黑暗里亮了一次。\n\n【七位女主专属剧情】\n\n你迈出脚步，开启了在这片天地间的全新契约篇章……", "branches": [{"tag": "A", "title": "环顾四周观察当前局势", "desc": "环顾四周观察当前局势"}, {"tag": "B", "title": "查看契约合同与身边角色", "desc": "查看契约合同与身边角色"}]}]', '<style>
:root {
  --bg: #0d1420;
  --bg-deep: #060b12;
  --panel: #131b28;
  --panel-dark: #0f1622;
  --panel-deep: #0a1019;
  --line: #26364a;
  --line-soft: #1b2739;
  --text: #d8dee9;
  --text-dim: #8c96a8;
  --gold: #c8b478;
  --gold-bright: #e6d7a3;
  --gold-dim: #7d6e48;
  --red: #c26378;
  --red-bright: #e08093;
  --blood: #7a2e40;
  --mc: #6fe0b0;
  --neon-blue: #6fc9ff;
  --neon-pink: #ff7ab8;
  --neon-violet: #a58aff;
  --rain: #b8d0e8;
}

/* ===== 外层容器：海城雨夜 ===== */
x {
  display: block;
  position: relative;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, rgba(111, 201, 255, .06), transparent 40%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 85% 100%, rgba(165, 138, 255, .05), transparent 45%),
    var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  padding: 22px 18px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  box-shadow:
    0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, .75),
    inset 0 0 60px rgba(20, 40, 70, .35);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* 内描边 */
x::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 6px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(111, 201, 255, .08);
  border-radius: 16px;
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* ===== 时间地点栏 ===== */
hd {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px 14px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #131b28, #0d1420);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 12px 16px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 24px rgba(20, 50, 90, .25);
}

hd l {
  color: var(--neon-blue);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  font-size: 12px;
  margin-right: 2px;
  text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(111, 201, 255, .5);
}

hd l::after {
  content: "┊";
  margin-left: 4px;
  color: #3d5570;
}

hd v {
  background: #1b2739;
  padding: 2px 12px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid #3d5570;
  color: #dceaee;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  font-size: 14px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(111, 201, 255, .15);
}

/* ===== 正文区：纯黑底白字（去左线） ===== */
main {
  display: block;
  background: #000000;
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 16px 18px;
  margin: 18px 0;
}

main p {
  text-indent: 2em;
  color: #ffffff;
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  font-size: 15px;
}

main p:last-child {
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

/* 主角对话：翡翠青绿 */
main p.mc {
  color: #6fe0b0;
  font-weight: 600;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #6fe0b0;
}

/* 六位客户 + 妹妹对话色 */
main p.npc-lin {
  color: #86b8ff;
  font-weight: 600;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #86b8ff;
}
main p.npc-gu {
  color: #ff8a6a;
  font-weight: 600;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ff8a6a;
}
main p.npc-su {
  color: #d6a5ff;
  font-weight: 600;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #d6a5ff;
}
main p.npc-an {
  color: #ffc26a;
  font-weight: 600;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffc26a;
}
main p.npc-ye {
  color: #ff9eb0;
  font-weight: 600;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ff9eb0;
}
main p.npc-wen {
  color: #f2b8e0;
  font-weight: 600;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #f2b8e0;
}
main p.npc-xia {
  color: #ddd08a;
  font-weight: 600;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ddd08a;
}

/* ===== 折叠面板 ===== */
details {
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--panel), var(--panel-dark));
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 14px;
  margin: 12px 0;
  padding: 4px 14px 10px;
  transition: box-shadow .3s ease;
  position: relative;
}

details[open] {
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 1px rgba(111, 201, 255, .10),
    0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, .55),
    inset 0 0 40px rgba(20, 50, 90, .18);
}

summary {
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--gold);
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  padding: 10px 0;
  list-style: none;
  position: relative;
  text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(200, 180, 120, .2);
}

summary::-webkit-details-marker {
  display: none;
}

summary::marker {
  color: var(--neon-blue);
}

summary::before {
  content: "☂";
  display: inline-block;
  margin-right: 8px;
  color: var(--neon-blue);
  font-size: 13px;
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  transition: all .3s ease;
  text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(111, 201, 255, .5);
}

details[open] summary::before {
  color: var(--gold-bright);
  text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(230, 215, 163, .7);
}

/* ===== 折叠行 ===== */
c {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  padding: 7px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(111, 201, 255, .12);
}

c:last-child {
  border-bottom: none;
}

c l {
  flex: 0 0 96px;
  color: #8aa3c0;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  font-size: 14px;
  padding-top: 1px;
}

c v {
  color: #dfe6f0;
  font-size: 14px;
  flex: 1;
}

/* ===== 第1格：勇者状态 ===== */
details:nth-of-type(1) {
  border: 1px solid rgba(111, 201, 255, .30);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(111, 201, 255, .05);
}

details:nth-of-type(1) summary {
  color: #b8dcff;
}

details:nth-of-type(1) c l {
  color: #8aaac8;
}

details:nth-of-type(1) c v {
  color: #e4eefa;
}

/* ===== 第2格：互动角色 ===== */
details:nth-of-type(2) {
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1a1730, #100d1e);
  border: 1px solid rgba(165, 138, 255, .35);
  box-shadow:
    0 0 22px rgba(165, 138, 255, .15),
    inset 0 0 40px rgba(165, 138, 255, .06);
}

details:nth-of-type(2) summary {
  color: #c8b0ff;
}

details:nth-of-type(2) summary::before {
  color: var(--neon-violet);
}

details:nth-of-type(2) c l {
  color: #a99dd0;
}

details:nth-of-type(2) c v {
  color: #eae0ff;
}

/* ===== 第3格：关系进度（六色雨滴） ===== */
details:nth-of-type(3) {
  border: 1px solid rgba(38, 54, 74, .9);
}

details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-lin {
  background: rgba(134, 184, 255, .10);
  border-left: 3px solid #86b8ff;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin: 6px 0;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 16px rgba(134, 184, 255, .08);
}
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-lin l { color: #a8c9ff; }
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-lin v { color: #d5e5ff; }

details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-gu {
  background: rgba(255, 138, 106, .10);
  border-left: 3px solid #ff8a6a;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin: 6px 0;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 16px rgba(255, 138, 106, .08);
}
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-gu l { color: #ffb29e; }
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-gu v { color: #ffd5c9; }

details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-su {
  background: rgba(214, 165, 255, .10);
  border-left: 3px solid #d6a5ff;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin: 6px 0;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 16px rgba(214, 165, 255, .08);
}
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-su l { color: #ddb9ff; }
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-su v { color: #ecd6ff; }

details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-an {
  background: rgba(255, 194, 106, .10);
  border-left: 3px solid #ffc26a;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin: 6px 0;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 16px rgba(255, 194, 106, .08);
}
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-an l { color: #ffd195; }
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-an v { color: #ffe6c4; }

details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-ye {
  background: rgba(255, 158, 176, .10);
  border-left: 3px solid #ff9eb0;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin: 6px 0;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 16px rgba(255, 158, 176, .08);
}
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-ye l { color: #ffb5c2; }
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-ye v { color: #ffd5dc; }

details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-wen {
  background: rgba(242, 184, 224, .10);
  border-left: 3px solid #f2b8e0;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin: 6px 0;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 16px rgba(242, 184, 224, .08);
}
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-wen l { color: #f5c7e8; }
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-wen v { color: #fadff0; }

details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-xia {
  background: rgba(221, 208, 138, .12);
  border-left: 3px solid #ddd08a;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin: 6px 0;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 16px rgba(221, 208, 138, .10);
}
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-xia l { color: #e2d8a3; }
details:nth-of-type(3) c.tag-xia v { color: #eee9c9; }

/* ===== 第4格：记忆回廊 ===== */
details:nth-of-type(4) {
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0b121c, #060b12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(111, 201, 255, .18);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, .7);
}

details:nth-of-type(4) summary {
  color: #9cb8dc;
  letter-spacing: 2.5px;
}

details:nth-of-type(4) summary::before {
  color: var(--neon-blue);
}

/* 记忆回廊内层 */
nn {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 10px;
  padding-left: 6px;
  border-left: 2px solid rgba(111, 201, 255, .18);
}

nn details {
  margin: 8px 0;
  border: 1px solid #26364a;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 4px 12px 8px;
  background: #0d1420;
  box-shadow: none;
}

nn details[open] {
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, .6);
}

nn summary {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: #9cb8dc;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  padding: 8px 0;
}

nn summary::before {
  content: "◇";
  margin-right: 6px;
  color: #4d6076;
  font-size: 11px;
}

nn details[open] summary::before {
  content: "◆";
  color: var(--neon-blue);
  transform: none;
}

nn mem {
  display: block;
  margin: 4px 0;
}

nn mt {
  display: block;
  color: #c8b478;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 13px;
  margin: 6px 0 4px;
  letter-spacing: .5px;
}

nn mi {
  display: block;
  color: #9aa8ba;
  font-size: 13px;
  padding: 4px 0 4px 10px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(111, 201, 255, .10);
}

nn mi:last-child {
  border-bottom: none;
}

/* 内层第1个：配置 */
nn details:nth-of-type(1) {
  border: 1px solid #35506b;
  background: #0c1a26;
}
nn details:nth-of-type(1) summary {
  color: #a8c9e8;
}
nn details:nth-of-type(1) summary::before {
  color: #6fc9ff;
}

/* 内层第2个：LTM */
nn details:nth-of-type(2) {
  border: 1px solid rgba(165, 138, 255, .35);
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, #14101f, #0c0a18);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(165, 138, 255, .06);
}
nn details:nth-of-type(2) summary {
  color: #c8b0ff;
  text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(165, 138, 255, .4);
}
nn details:nth-of-type(2) summary::before {
  color: var(--neon-violet);
}
nn details:nth-of-type(2) mi {
  color: #d5c9e8;
}

/* 内层第3个：STM */
nn details:nth-of-type(3) {
  border: 1px solid rgba(111, 201, 255, .40);
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0c1a26, #0a121c);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(111, 201, 255, .08);
}
nn details:nth-of-type(3) summary {
  color: #9cd8ff;
  text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(111, 201, 255, .45);
}
nn details:nth-of-type(3) summary::before {
  color: var(--neon-blue);
}
nn details:nth-of-type(3) mi {
  color: #c4d8ef;
}

/* ===== 兜底旧标签 ===== */
mem {
  display: block;
  margin: 8px 0;
}

mt {
  display: block;
  color: #c8b478;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 14px;
  margin: 8px 0 5px;
}

mi {
  display: block;
  color: #9aa8ba;
  font-size: 13px;
  padding-left: 18px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

/* ===== 第5格：推荐行动 ===== */
details:nth-of-type(5) {
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 122, 184, .30);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(255, 122, 184, .05);
}

details:nth-of-type(5) summary {
  color: #ffa8cf;
}

details:nth-of-type(5) summary::before {
  color: var(--neon-pink);
}

act {
  display: block;
  margin: 8px 0;
  padding: 10px 14px 10px 16px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1424, #120d18);
  border-radius: 12px;
  border: 1px solid #534764;
  color: #d0b8d8;
  transition: all .3s ease;
  cursor: pointer;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

act::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 3px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--neon-pink), var(--neon-violet));
  opacity: .6;
}

act:hover {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2a1e38, #1c1226);
  border-color: #a26ab8;
  color: #f5d5f0;
  transform: translateX(6px);
  box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(255, 122, 184, .35);
}

act:hover::before {
  opacity: 1;
}

/* ===== 滚动条 ===== */
x ::-webkit-scrollbar {
  width: 6px;
}

x ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
  background: transparent;
}

x ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
  background: rgba(111, 201, 255, .25);
  border-radius: 3px;
}

x ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
  background: rgba(111, 201, 255, .5);
}

/* ===== 移动端 ===== */
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  c {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }
  c l {
    flex: none;
  }
  hd {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  x {
    padding: 16px 12px;
  }
}
