<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<title>姐夫，就今天好不好？· 开局</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
:root{
--color-bg:#0f0c0e;
--color-surface:rgba(28,22,26,0.78);
--color-surface-solid:#1c161a;
--color-border:rgba(200,160,130,0.18);
--color-text:#f0e6e0;
--color-text-muted:#a8968e;
--color-primary:#c77d6b;
--color-primary-hover:#db9180;
--color-accent:#e7b49b;
--color-gold:#cfaa7a;
--color-danger:#b8564a;
--space-xs:4px;
--space-sm:8px;
--space-md:16px;
--space-lg:28px;
--space-xl:44px;
--radius-sm:6px;
--radius-md:14px;
--radius-lg:24px;
--radius-full:999px;
--font-hero:2.4rem;
--font-title:1.4rem;
--font-body:1rem;
--font-sm:0.82rem;
--font-xs:0.72rem;
--shadow-sm:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
--shadow-md:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
--shadow-lg:0 24px 64px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
--shadow-glow:0 0 24px rgba(199,125,107,0.25);
--transition-fast:150ms ease;
--transition-base:280ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
--transition-slow:600ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
--ease-out:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
}
html{font-size:16px;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;}
body{
background:var(--color-bg);
color:var(--color-text);
font-family:"PingFang SC","Hiragino Sans GB","Microsoft YaHei",system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
line-height:1.65;
min-height:100vh;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
overflow-x:hidden;
-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}
.atmo-bg{
position:fixed;
inset:0;
z-index:0;
pointer-events:none;
background:
radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 20% 10%,rgba(199,125,107,0.08),transparent 60%),
radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 85% 90%,rgba(120,80,100,0.12),transparent 60%),
radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 50% 50%,rgba(207,170,122,0.04),transparent 70%);
}
.atmo-grain{
position:fixed;
inset:0;
z-index:1;
pointer-events:none;
opacity:0.035;
background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=''0 0 256 256'' xmlns=''http://www.w3.org/2000/svg''%3E%3Cfilter id=''n''%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=''fractalNoise'' baseFrequency=''0.9'' numOctaves=''4''/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=''100%25'' height=''100%25'' filter=''url(%23n)''/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
background-size:180px;
mix-blend-mode:overlay;
}
.mote{
position:fixed;
width:3px;
height:3px;
border-radius:50%;
background:var(--color-gold);
opacity:0;
pointer-events:none;
z-index:2;
filter:blur(0.5px);
}
@keyframes moteFloat{
0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(0) scale(0.5);}
15%{opacity:0.6;}
50%{opacity:0.3;}
85%{opacity:0.5;}
100%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-90vh) scale(1.2);}
}
.mote:nth-child(1){left:8%;animation:moteFloat 14s ease-in infinite;animation-delay:0s;}
.mote:nth-child(2){left:22%;animation:moteFloat 18s ease-in infinite;animation-delay:3s;width:2px;height:2px;}
.mote:nth-child(3){left:41%;animation:moteFloat 16s ease-in infinite;animation-delay:7s;}
.mote:nth-child(4){left:63%;animation:moteFloat 20s ease-in infinite;animation-delay:1s;width:4px;height:4px;opacity:0.15;}
.mote:nth-child(5){left:78%;animation:moteFloat 15s ease-in infinite;animation-delay:5s;}
.mote:nth-child(6){left:92%;animation:moteFloat 17s ease-in infinite;animation-delay:9s;width:2px;height:2px;}
#intro-overlay{
position:fixed;
inset:0;
z-index:999;
background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%,#1c1418 0%,#0a0709 100%);
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
flex-direction:column;
transition:opacity 1s var(--ease-out),visibility 1s;
}
#intro-overlay.hidden{
opacity:0;
visibility:hidden;
pointer-events:none;
}
.intro-ring{
width:120px;
height:120px;
border-radius:50%;
border:1px solid rgba(199,125,107,0.3);
position:relative;
animation:introSpin 4s linear infinite;
}
.intro-ring::before,.intro-ring::after{
content:"";
position:absolute;
border-radius:50%;
border:1px solid transparent;
}
.intro-ring::before{
inset:14px;
border-top-color:var(--color-accent);
border-right-color:rgba(207,170,122,0.4);
animation:introSpin 2.2s linear infinite reverse;
}
.intro-ring::after{
inset:34px;
border-bottom-color:var(--color-primary);
border-left-color:rgba(199,125,107,0.3);
animation:introSpin 1.6s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes introSpin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
.intro-text{
margin-top:var(--space-lg);
font-size:var(--font-xs);
letter-spacing:0.5em;
text-indent:0.5em;
color:var(--color-text-muted);
animation:introPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes introPulse{0%,100%{opacity:0.4;}50%{opacity:1;}}
.intro-skip{
position:absolute;
top:var(--space-lg);
right:var(--space-lg);
background:transparent;
border:1px solid var(--color-border);
color:var(--color-text-muted);
padding:var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
border-radius:var(--radius-full);
font-size:var(--font-xs);
cursor:pointer;
letter-spacing:0.1em;
transition:all var(--transition-base);
min-height:44px;
min-width:44px;
}
.intro-skip:hover{
border-color:var(--color-primary);
color:var(--color-accent);
}
main{
position:relative;
z-index:3;
flex:1;
width:100%;
max-width:880px;
margin:0 auto;
padding:var(--space-xl) var(--space-md) 120px;
}
.reveal{
opacity:0;
transform:translateY(24px);
animation:revealUp 1s var(--ease-out) forwards;
}
@keyframes revealUp{
to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
}
.reveal-d1{animation-delay:0.15s;}
.reveal-d2{animation-delay:0.3s;}
.reveal-d3{animation-delay:0.45s;}
.reveal-d4{animation-delay:0.6s;}
.reveal-d5{animation-delay:0.75s;}
.reveal-d6{animation-delay:0.9s;}
.hero{
text-align:center;
padding:var(--space-lg) 0 var(--space-xl);
position:relative;
}
.hero-kicker{
font-size:var(--font-xs);
letter-spacing:0.6em;
text-indent:0.6em;
color:var(--color-gold);
text-transform:uppercase;
margin-bottom:var(--space-md);
opacity:0.85;
}
.hero-title{
font-size:var(--font-hero);
font-weight:800;
letter-spacing:0.08em;
line-height:1.15;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5e6dc 0%,#e7b49b 40%,#c77d6b 70%,#a05f52 100%);
-webkit-background-clip:text;
background-clip:text;
-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
color:transparent;
margin-bottom:var(--space-sm);
position:relative;
}
.hero-title::after{
content:"";
display:block;
width:56px;
height:2px;
margin:var(--space-md) auto 0;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--color-gold),transparent);
animation:lineBreath 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes lineBreath{0%,100%{opacity:0.4;width:40px;}50%{opacity:1;width:90px;}}
.hero-sub{
font-size:var(--font-sm);
color:var(--color-text-muted);
letter-spacing:0.2em;
margin-top:var(--space-sm);
}
.section{
margin-bottom:var(--space-xl);
position:relative;
}
.section-head{
display:flex;
align-items:baseline;
gap:var(--space-sm);
margin-bottom:var(--space-lg);
position:relative;
}
.section-num{
font-size:var(--font-xs);
color:var(--color-gold);
letter-spacing:0.3em;
font-weight:700;
opacity:0.7;
}
.section-title{
font-size:var(--font-title);
font-weight:700;
letter-spacing:0.12em;
color:var(--color-accent);
position:relative;
padding-bottom:var(--space-sm);
}
.section-title::after{
content:"";
position:absolute;
left:0;
bottom:0;
width:100%;
height:1px;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--color-primary),transparent);
transform-origin:left;
animation:underlineGrow 1.2s var(--ease-out) forwards;
}
@keyframes underlineGrow{from{transform:scaleX(0);}to{transform:scaleX(1);}}
.card{
background:var(--color-surface);
backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
border:1px solid var(--color-border);
border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
padding:var(--space-lg);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);
position:relative;
overflow:hidden;
transition:transform var(--transition-base),box-shadow var(--transition-base),border-color var(--transition-base);
}
.card::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
top:0;
left:0;
right:0;
height:1px;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(231,180,155,0.5),transparent);
opacity:0.6;
}
.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-4px);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg),var(--shadow-glow);
border-color:rgba(199,125,107,0.35);
}
.story-text{
font-size:var(--font-body);
line-height:2;
color:var(--color-text);
letter-spacing:0.02em;
}
.story-text em{
font-style:normal;
color:var(--color-accent);
font-weight:600;
}
.story-text .highlight{
color:var(--color-gold);
font-weight:600;
border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(207,170,122,0.4);
}
.story-divider{
display:flex;
align-items:center;
gap:var(--space-md);
margin:var(--space-md) 0;
color:var(--color-gold);
font-size:var(--font-xs);
letter-spacing:0.3em;
opacity:0.5;
}
.story-divider::before,.story-divider::after{
content:"";
flex:1;
height:1px;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--color-border),transparent);
}
.char-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
gap:var(--space-md);
}
.char-card{
background:var(--color-surface);
backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
border:1px solid var(--color-border);
border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
padding:var(--space-md);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);
position:relative;
overflow:hidden;
transition:all var(--transition-base);
cursor:pointer;
min-height:44px;
}
.char-card:hover{
transform:translateY(-6px) scale(1.012);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-md),0 0 30px rgba(199,125,107,0.18);
border-color:rgba(199,125,107,0.4);
}
.char-card::after{
content:"";
position:absolute;
top:-50%;
left:-50%;
width:200%;
height:200%;
background:conic-gradient(from 0deg,transparent,rgba(199,125,107,0.06),transparent 30%);
animation:charShine 6s linear infinite;
pointer-events:none;
}
@keyframes charShine{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
.char-portrait{
display:block;
width:256px;
height:341px;
max-width:100%;
margin:0 auto var(--space-md);
border-radius:var(--radius-md);
background-size:cover;
background-position:center;
background-repeat:no-repeat;
box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);
position:relative;
z-index:1;
}
.portrait-sunian{
background-image:url(''https://catai.wiki/9cbb9ada-4afd-4a6b-d72c-b9db9b424900/w=3000'');
}
.portrait-suhui{
background-image:url(''https://catai.wiki/8895f373-4471-4f47-566a-b9b35c9ecc00/w=3000'');
}
.char-name{
font-size:1.15rem;
font-weight:700;
letter-spacing:0.08em;
margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);
color:var(--color-text);
position:relative;
z-index:1;
}
.char-tag{
font-size:var(--font-xs);
color:var(--color-gold);
letter-spacing:0.15em;
margin-bottom:var(--space-sm);
opacity:0.8;
position:relative;
z-index:1;
}
.char-desc{
font-size:var(--font-sm);
color:var(--color-text-muted);
line-height:1.75;
max-height:0;
overflow:hidden;
transition:max-height 0.5s var(--ease-out),margin 0.4s var(--ease-out);
position:relative;
z-index:1;
}
.char-card.expanded .char-desc{
max-height:600px;
margin-top:var(--space-sm);
}
.char-meta{
display:flex;
flex-wrap:wrap;
gap:var(--space-xs);
margin-top:var(--space-sm);
position:relative;
z-index:1;
}
.char-meta span{
font-size:var(--font-xs);
padding:2px 10px;
border-radius:var(--radius-full);
border:1px solid var(--color-border);
color:var(--color-text-muted);
letter-spacing:0.05em;
transition:all var(--transition-fast);
}
.char-card:hover .char-meta span{
border-color:rgba(199,125,107,0.4);
color:var(--color-accent);
}
.male-card{
background:var(--color-surface);
backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
border:1px solid var(--color-border);
border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
padding:var(--space-lg);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);
display:flex;
gap:var(--space-lg);
align-items:flex-start;
transition:all var(--transition-base);
}
.male-card:hover{
border-color:rgba(199,125,107,0.35);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-md),0 0 30px rgba(207,170,122,0.12);
}
.male-card .char-avatar{
flex-shrink:0;
width:64px;
height:64px;
font-size:1.7rem;
}
.male-info h3{
font-size:1.15rem;
font-weight:700;
letter-spacing:0.08em;
margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);
}
.male-info .char-tag{margin-bottom:var(--space-sm);}
.male-info p{
font-size:var(--font-sm);
color:var(--color-text-muted);
line-height:1.8;
}
.char-avatar{
width:56px;
height:56px;
border-radius:50%;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
font-size:1.5rem;
font-weight:700;
margin-bottom:var(--space-md);
position:relative;
border:1px solid var(--color-border);
}
.avatar-male{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2e2a1a,#1e1a12);
color:#cfaa7a;
}
.scene-card{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(40,28,32,0.9),rgba(24,18,22,0.9));
border:1px solid rgba(199,125,107,0.25);
border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
padding:var(--space-lg);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-md),inset 0 0 60px rgba(199,125,107,0.04);
position:relative;
overflow:hidden;
}
.scene-card::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
top:0;
left:0;
width:100%;
height:3px;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--color-primary),var(--color-gold),var(--color-primary));
background-size:200% 100%;
animation:sceneBar 3s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes sceneBar{to{background-position:200% 0;}}
.scene-card .story-text{
font-size:var(--font-body);
line-height:2.1;
}
.scene-card .story-text strong{
color:var(--color-accent);
font-weight:700;
}
.scene-card .story-text .whisper{
color:var(--color-gold);
font-style:italic;
opacity:0.9;
}
.form-card{
background:var(--color-surface);
backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
border:1px solid var(--color-border);
border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
padding:var(--space-lg);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);
}
.form-group{margin-bottom:var(--space-md);}
.form-group label{
display:block;
font-size:var(--font-xs);
color:var(--color-gold);
letter-spacing:0.15em;
margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);
text-transform:uppercase;
}
.form-group input[type="text"],
.form-group textarea{
width:100%;
padding:12px 14px;
border-radius:var(--radius-md);
border:1px solid var(--color-border);
background:rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
color:var(--color-text);
font-size:var(--font-body);
font-family:inherit;
outline:none;
transition:border-color var(--transition-base),box-shadow var(--transition-base);
min-height:44px;
}
.form-group input[type="text"]:focus,
.form-group textarea:focus{
border-color:var(--color-primary);
box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(199,125,107,0.12);
}
.form-group input::placeholder,
.form-group textarea::placeholder{color:#6b5a5e;}
.form-group textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:64px;line-height:1.6;}
.form-row{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
gap:var(--space-md);
}
.form-row .form-group{margin-bottom:0;}
.form-row input[type="range"]{
width:100%;
height:44px;
background:transparent;
-webkit-appearance:none;
appearance:none;
cursor:pointer;
}
.form-row input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track{
height:3px;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--color-primary),var(--color-gold));
border-radius:2px;
}
.form-row input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb{
-webkit-appearance:none;
appearance:none;
width:20px;
height:20px;
margin-top:-8.5px;
border-radius:50%;
background:var(--color-accent);
border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(231,180,155,0.6);
}
.form-row input[type="range"]::-moz-range-track{
height:3px;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--color-primary),var(--color-gold));
border-radius:2px;
}
.form-row input[type="range"]::-moz-range-thumb{
width:20px;
height:20px;
border-radius:50%;
background:var(--color-accent);
border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(231,180,155,0.6);
}
.range-val{
font-size:var(--font-sm);
color:var(--color-accent);
font-weight:600;
text-align:center;
margin-top:var(--space-xs);
display:block;
}
.choice-grid{
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
gap:var(--space-md);
margin-top:var(--space-lg);
}
.choice-btn{
display:flex;
align-items:flex-start;
gap:var(--space-md);
padding:var(--space-lg) var(--space-md);
background:var(--color-surface);
border:1px solid var(--color-border);
border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
cursor:pointer;
transition:all var(--transition-base);
position:relative;
overflow:hidden;
text-align:left;
color:var(--color-text);
font-size:var(--font-body);
font-family:inherit;
line-height:1.6;
min-height:44px;
}
.choice-btn::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
inset:0;
background:radial-gradient(circle at var(--mx,50%) var(--my,50%),rgba(199,125,107,0.15),transparent 60%);
opacity:0;
transition:opacity 0.4s;
}
.choice-btn:hover::before{opacity:1;}
.choice-btn:hover{
border-color:var(--color-primary);
transform:translateX(6px);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-md),0 0 30px rgba(199,125,107,0.15);
background:rgba(40,28,32,0.85);
}
.choice-btn:active{transform:translateX(6px) scale(0.985);}
.choice-btn .choice-icon{
flex-shrink:0;
width:42px;
height:42px;
border-radius:var(--radius-md);
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
font-size:1.2rem;
background:rgba(199,125,107,0.12);
border:1px solid rgba(199,125,107,0.2);
transition:all var(--transition-base);
}
.choice-btn:hover .choice-icon{
background:rgba(199,125,107,0.25);
transform:scale(1.08) rotate(-4deg);
border-color:var(--color-primary);
}
.choice-content{flex:1;}
.choice-content .choice-title{
font-weight:700;
color:var(--color-accent);
font-size:1.05rem;
letter-spacing:0.06em;
margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);
display:block;
}
.choice-content .choice-desc{
font-size:var(--font-sm);
color:var(--color-text-muted);
line-height:1.7;
}
.choice-btn::after{
content:"";
position:absolute;
right:var(--space-md);
top:50%;
transform:translateY(-50%);
width:8px;
height:8px;
border-radius:50%;
background:var(--color-primary);
opacity:0;
transition:all var(--transition-base);
}
.choice-btn:hover::after{
opacity:1;
animation:pulseDot 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes pulseDot{
0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(199,125,107,0.5);}
50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(199,125,107,0);}
}
.hint-bubble{
margin-top:var(--space-lg);
padding:var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
background:rgba(199,125,107,0.06);
border:1px solid rgba(199,125,107,0.15);
border-radius:var(--radius-md);
font-size:var(--font-sm);
color:var(--color-text-muted);
display:flex;
align-items:center;
gap:var(--space-sm);
animation:hintFloat 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes hintFloat{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(-4px);}}
.hint-bubble::before{
content:"✦";
color:var(--color-gold);
font-size:0.9rem;
}
.copy-bar{
position:fixed;
left:0;
right:0;
bottom:0;
z-index:100;
padding:14px 16px calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));
background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(15,12,14,0.98) 60%,rgba(15,12,14,0.75));
backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);
}
.copy-btn{
display:block;
width:100%;
max-width:880px;
margin:0 auto;
padding:16px 20px;
border:none;
border-radius:var(--radius-md);
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c77d6b 0%,#a05f52 100%);
color:#fff;
font-size:1.05rem;
font-weight:700;
letter-spacing:0.15em;
font-family:inherit;
cursor:pointer;
box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(199,125,107,0.4);
transition:transform var(--transition-base),box-shadow var(--transition-base);
min-height:44px;
}
.copy-btn:hover{
transform:translateY(-2px);
box-shadow:0 14px 36px rgba(199,125,107,0.55);
}
.copy-btn:active{transform:translateY(0) scale(0.985);}
.toast{
position:fixed;
left:50%;
bottom:110px;
transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
background:rgba(28,22,26,0.98);
color:var(--color-accent);
padding:11px 24px;
border-radius:var(--radius-full);
font-size:var(--font-sm);
letter-spacing:0.05em;
border:1px solid rgba(199,125,107,0.4);
box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
opacity:0;
pointer-events:none;
transition:all var(--transition-base);
z-index:999;
}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);}
@media(max-width:640px){
:root{
--font-hero:1.8rem;
--font-title:1.15rem;
--space-xl:32px;
}
main{padding:var(--space-lg) var(--space-md) 120px;}
.char-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
.male-card{flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-md);}
.choice-btn{padding:var(--space-md);}
.hero-title{letter-spacing:0.05em;}
html{font-size:17px;}
.char-portrait{width:200px;height:267px;}
.form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--space-sm);}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
*,.reveal,.mote,.intro-ring,.intro-ring::before,.intro-ring::after,
.char-card::after,.scene-card::before,.hint-bubble,.hero-title::after{
animation-duration:0.001ms !important;
animation-iteration-count:1 !important;
transition-duration:0.001ms !important;
}
.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="atmo-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="atmo-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="mote" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="mote" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="mote" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="mote" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="mote" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="mote" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div id="intro-overlay" role="dialog" aria-label="开场动画">
<div class="intro-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="intro-text">姐 夫 · 就 今 天 好 不 好</div>
<button class="intro-skip" id="skipIntro" aria-label="跳过开场动画">跳过</button>
</div>
<main>
<header class="hero reveal">
<div class="hero-kicker">A Summer Afternoon</div>
<h1 class="hero-title">姐夫，就今天好不好？</h1>
<p class="hero-sub">—— 一个普通的午后，两个女人，和一个男人 ——</p>
</header>
<section class="section reveal reveal-d1" aria-labelledby="sec-story">
<div class="section-head">
<span class="section-num">01</span>
<h2 class="section-title" id="sec-story">前情提要</h2>
</div>
<div class="card">
<p class="story-text">
七月的城市像一口蒸锅。蝉鸣从梧桐树里渗下来，黏在皮肤上，甩不掉。<br><br>
<em>苏慧</em>一早就去了医院。孕期第二十二周，例行产检。她出门前亲了亲你的嘴角，说中午可能和同学吃饭，晚点回。语气轻描淡写，像任何一个平常的周四。<br><br>
你送她到门口，转身收拾餐桌。影碟机旁那张碟忘了收——昨晚一个人看的，封面上女人仰着头，嘴微张。你想着下楼买杯咖啡就回来，来得及。<br><br>
门铃响了。<br><br>
是<span class="highlight">苏念</span>。苏慧的妹妹，今年高三刚毕业，穿着蓝白校服，手里拎着一个纸袋。<span class="whisper">"姐夫，姐姐让我把胎教CD带过来……"</span>她低头换鞋，低马尾从肩头滑下来，露出后颈一小截白皙的皮肤。<br><br>
你说去楼下买咖啡，让她自己坐。电梯下行的时候，你突然想起来——<strong>影碟机还没关。</strong><br><br>
等你推开门，电视屏幕上已经在播了。画面里男女交叠，声音从音响里淌出来，整个客厅像被什么透明的、滚烫的东西灌满了。<br><br>
苏念坐在沙发正中间，双腿紧紧夹着，校服裙摆被她攥得发皱。脸从耳根红到脖子，眼睛却盯着屏幕，没换台，也没逃。听见门响，她猛地一僵，转过头看你，嘴唇动了动，什么都没说出来。<br><br>
手机震了。是苏慧。<span class="whisper">"晚上不用等我吃饭了，我和同学吃完再去逛会儿。"</span><br><br>
整个下午，家里只剩两个人。
</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section reveal reveal-d2" aria-labelledby="sec-char">
<div class="section-head">
<span class="section-num">02</span>
<h2 class="section-title" id="sec-char">人物档案</h2>
</div>
<div class="char-grid">
<article class="char-card" data-char="sunian" tabindex="0">
<div class="char-portrait portrait-sunian" role="img" aria-label="苏念立绘"></div>
<h3 class="char-name">苏 念</h3>
<div class="char-tag">小姨子 · 应届高中生</div>
<p class="char-desc">
158cm娇小瘦小，清秀可人。B罩杯偏小，乳头敏感，私处阴毛稀少近似白虎馒头穴，带处子体香。黑发低双马尾、齐刘海、螺旋侧发、黄瞳。正穿蓝白夏季校服，翻领POLO款带扣子，运动裤。<br><br>
日常黏姐姐、爱喝鸟窝咖啡、主动蹭姐夫。看A片会脸红夹腿却逞强不换台。被侵犯时牙关紧逼口是心非，情动后失去意识任人索取。被调教先抗拒后乖巧，会主动叫「主人」「小贱奴」。
</p>
<div class="char-meta">
<span>158cm</span><span>B罩杯</span><span>白虎馒头穴</span><span>处子</span><span>低双马尾</span>
</div>
</article>
<article class="char-card" data-char="suhui" tabindex="0">
<div class="char-portrait portrait-suhui" role="img" aria-label="苏慧立绘"></div>
<h3 class="char-name">苏 慧</h3>
<div class="char-tag">正妻 · 孕期二十二周</div>
<p class="char-desc">
170cm高挑丰满，浅棕长发、棕瞳，D罩杯孕期微胀、乳晕变深。腹部微隆不显怀。孕期性欲极强，禁欲只是嘴上说说。对妹妹宠爱纵容，撞见后吃醋少兴奋多，会主动参与三人行，主导姐妹轮流。<br><br>
语言成熟直接带诱导性：「妹妹以后也是家里人」「肚子里的呢，你倒是再深点」。姐姐不是受害者，是合伙人。
</p>
<div class="char-meta">
<span>170cm</span><span>D罩杯</span><span>孕22周</span><span>浅棕长发</span><span>合伙人</span>
</div>
</article>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section reveal reveal-d3" aria-labelledby="sec-male">
<div class="section-head">
<span class="section-num">03</span>
<h2 class="section-title" id="sec-male">关于你</h2>
</div>
<div class="male-card">
<div class="char-avatar avatar-male" aria-hidden="true">你</div>
<div class="male-info">
<h3>姐夫 · 丈夫 · 普通人</h3>
<div class="char-tag">三十岁上下 · 都市上班族</div>
<p>
苏慧的丈夫，苏念的姐夫。不高不矮，不胖不瘦，走在人群里不会被人多看一眼。<br>
婚后三年，和妻子感情稳定，性生活规律。但苏念每次来家里蹭饭，弯腰捡东西时校服领口敞开的那一瞬间——你知道自己看过不只一次。<br>
今天你只想下楼买杯咖啡。
</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section reveal reveal-d4" aria-labelledby="sec-config">
<div class="section-head">
<span class="section-num">04</span>
<h2 class="section-title" id="sec-config">设定你自己</h2>
</div>
<div class="form-card">
<div class="form-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;">
<div class="form-group">
<label>姓名</label>
<input type="text" id="p-name" placeholder="未命名" autocomplete="off">
</div>
<div class="form-group">
<label>身份</label>
<input type="text" id="p-identity" placeholder="姐夫 / 都市上班族" autocomplete="off">
</div>
</div>
<div class="form-group" style="margin-top:16px;">
<label>一句话性格</label>
<textarea id="p-personality" placeholder="精虫上脑，占有欲强，喜欢掌控" rows="2"></textarea>
</div>
<div class="form-row" style="margin-top:20px;">
<div class="form-group">
<label>长度</label>
<input type="range" id="p-length" min="14" max="22" step="1" value="18">
<span class="range-val" id="v-length">18 cm</span>
</div>
<div class="form-group">
<label>周径</label>
<input type="range" id="p-girth" min="11" max="16" step="0.5" value="13">
<span class="range-val" id="v-girth">13 cm</span>
</div>
<div class="form-group">
<label>持久力</label>
<input type="range" id="p-stamina" min="10" max="60" step="5" value="30">
<span class="range-val" id="v-stamina">30 min</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section reveal reveal-d5" aria-labelledby="sec-scene">
<div class="section-head">
<span class="section-num">05</span>
<h2 class="section-title" id="sec-scene">此刻情状</h2>
</div>
<div class="scene-card">
<p class="story-text">
你站在玄关，手里拎着那杯冰美式，杯壁的水珠一滴滴落在鞋柜上。<br><br>
电视里女人正在呻吟。苏念坐在沙发上，背对着你，但耳朵红得快要透光。她没回头，也没关机。校服运动裤的裤缝被夹在两条大腿之间，绷出一道浅浅的印记。低马尾的一缕碎发黏在出汗的侧颈上。<br><br>
她终于转过头来，黄瞳湿漉漉的，像被水浸过。<br>
<span class="whisper">"姐夫……这个，这个碟……"</span><br>
声音卡在喉咙里，没说完。她又转回去盯着屏幕，手指把运动裤的裤腰攥紧，像在跟自己较劲。<br><br>
<strong>空气里全是夏天的味道，和别的什么。</strong>
</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section reveal reveal-d6" aria-labelledby="sec-choice">
<div class="section-head">
<span class="section-num">06</span>
<h2 class="section-title" id="sec-choice">你要怎么做？</h2>
</div>
<div class="choice-grid" role="group" aria-label="开局行动选择">
<button class="choice-btn" data-choice="walk" aria-label="若无其事走过去坐下">
<div class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">☕</div>
<div class="choice-content">
<span class="choice-title">若无其事，走过去坐下</span>
<span class="choice-desc">把咖啡放在茶几上，在她旁边坐下来。什么都不说，让屏幕里的声音继续。看她能撑到什么时候。</span>
</div>
</button>
<button class="choice-btn" data-choice="turnoff" aria-label="走过去关掉电视">
<div class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">⏻</div>
<div class="choice-content">
<span class="choice-title">走过去，关掉电视</span>
<span class="choice-desc">伸手按掉电源，让客厅突然安静下来。转身问她要不要喝点什么，像什么都没发生过。</span>
</div>
</button>
<button class="choice-btn" data-choice="tease" aria-label="靠在门框上逗她">
<div class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</div>
<div class="choice-content">
<span class="choice-title">靠在门框上，逗她两句</span>
<span class="choice-desc">"好看吗？"——声音带点笑，居高临下地看着她。看她怎么接。</span>
</div>
</button>
<button class="choice-btn" data-choice="sit_close" aria-label="坐近一点，碰她">
<div class="choice-icon" aria-hidden="true">✧</div>
<div class="choice-content">
<span class="choice-title">坐过去，腿挨着她的腿</span>
<span class="choice-desc">沙发发出轻微的响声。你的膝盖碰到她的膝盖。她没有躲。</span>
</div>
</button>
</div>
<div class="hint-bubble">
所有选择都只是开始——后面的剧情，由你来推。
</div>
</section>
</main>
<div class="copy-bar">
