.content-card ul li{padding:5px 0 5px 18px;position:relative;font-size:14px;color:var(--dark-gray);line-height:1.7;}
.content-card ul li::before{content:''·'';position:absolute;left:4px;color:var(--primary);font-weight:700;font-size:18px;}
.highlight-box{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary) 0%,var(--primary-dark) 100%);color:#fff;padding:40px;margin:40px 0;text-align:center;}
.highlight-box h3{font-family:''Playfair Display'',serif;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:15px;}
.highlight-box p{font-size:15px;opacity:0.9;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;}
.divider{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:50px 0;gap:20px;}
.divider::before,.divider::after{content:'''';flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--border);}
.divider span{font-size:14px;color:var(--primary);letter-spacing:3px;}
.feature-list{list-style:none;columns:2;column-gap:40px;}
.feature-list li{padding:12px 0;padding-left:30px;position:relative;font-size:15px;color:var(--dark-gray);break-inside:avoid;}
.feature-list li::before{content:''/'';position:absolute;left:8px;color:var(--primary);font-weight:700;}
.form-section{max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px;background:var(--bg);border:2px solid var(--black);position:relative;}
.form-section::before{content:''CONFIGURATION'';position:absolute;top:-12px;left:30px;background:var(--bg);padding:0 15px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--primary);font-weight:700;}
.form-group{margin-bottom:28px;}
.form-label{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--black);margin-bottom:8px;}
.form-label .required{color:var(--primary);margin-left:3px;}
.form-label-hint{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--light-gray);font-weight:400;margin-top:2px;line-height:1.6;}
.form-input,.form-textarea{width:100%;padding:15px;font-size:15px;font-family:''Noto Sans SC'',sans-serif;border:2px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-cream);transition:all 0.3s ease;color:var(--black);}
.form-input:focus,.form-textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--primary);background:var(--bg);}
.form-textarea{min-height:90px;resize:vertical;line-height:1.8;}
.form-textarea.tall{min-height:120px;}
.form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:20px;}
.form-row-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;}
.radio-group{display:flex;gap:25px;padding:10px 0;}
.radio-label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:15px;color:var(--dark-gray);transition:color 0.3s ease;}
.radio-label:hover{color:var(--primary);}
.radio-label input{display:none;}
.radio-custom{width:20px;height:20px;border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:50%;position:relative;transition:all 0.3s ease;}
.radio-label input:checked+.radio-custom{border-color:var(--primary);}
.radio-label input:checked+.radio-custom::after{content:'''';position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:10px;height:10px;background:var(--primary);border-radius:50%;}
.form-divider{border:none;border-top:1px dashed var(--border);margin:35px 0 25px;position:relative;}
.form-divider-label{position:absolute;top:-10px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--bg);padding:0 15px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--light-gray);text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;}
.tag-toggle{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;color:var(--primary);cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px;padding:4px 0;border:none;background:none;font-family:''Noto Sans SC'',sans-serif;transition:opacity 0.2s;}
.tag-toggle:hover{opacity:0.7;}
.tag-toggle .arrow{transition:transform 0.3s;display:inline-block;}
.tag-toggle.open .arrow{transform:rotate(180deg);}
.tag-panel{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 0.4s ease,padding 0.3s ease;padding:0;}
.tag-panel.open{max-height:600px;padding:12px 0;}
.tag-category{margin-bottom:10px;}
.tag-category-name{font-size:11px;color:var(--light-gray);letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:6px;}
.tag-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}
.tag-item{padding:5px 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);border:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;user-select:none;background:var(--bg-cream);}
.tag-item:hover{border-color:var(--primary);color:var(--primary);background:#fff;}
.tag-item:active{transform:scale(0.95);}
.checkbox-group{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;padding:8px 0;}
.checkbox-label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border);transition:all 0.2s;user-select:none;background:var(--bg-cream);}
.checkbox-label:hover{border-color:var(--primary);color:var(--primary);}
.checkbox-label input{display:none;}
.checkbox-label.checked{border-color:var(--primary);color:var(--primary);background:rgba(37,99,235,0.05);font-weight:600;}
.cb-check{opacity:0;font-size:11px;transition:opacity 0.2s;}
.checkbox-label.checked .cb-check{opacity:1;}
.preview-container{margin-top:40px;padding:30px;background:var(--bg-cream);border-left:4px solid var(--primary);}
.preview-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:20px;}
.preview-box{font-family:''Noto Serif SC'',serif;font-size:15px;line-height:2;color:var(--dark-gray);white-space:pre-wrap;min-height:100px;user-select:text;-webkit-user-select:text;-moz-user-select:text;-ms-user-select:text;cursor:text;padding:15px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;}
.preview-box:focus{outline:2px solid var(--primary);outline-offset:2px;}
.btn-container{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:30px;}
.copy-btn{padding:18px 50px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--black);color:#fff;border:none;cursor:pointer;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:all 0.3s ease;font-family:''Noto Sans SC'',sans-serif;min-width:200px;}
.copy-btn:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:0.7;}
.copy-btn::before{content:'''';position:absolute;top:0;left:-100%;width:100%;height:100%;background:var(--primary);transition:left 0.3s ease;z-index:0;}
.copy-btn:hover:not(:disabled)::before{left:0;}
.copy-btn span{position:relative;z-index:1;}
.copy-btn:active:not(:disabled){transform:scale(0.98);}
footer{text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;margin-top:60px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:13px;color:var(--light-gray);}
@media(max-width:768px){
  .header{padding:40px 15px 30px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-1px;}
  .intro-section{padding:25px;margin:0 15px 40px;}.intro-section::before{font-size:80px;top:-10px;left:10px;}
  .tab-navigation{gap:5px;padding:0 10px 15px;}.tab-btn{padding:10px 15px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;}
  .form-section{padding:25px 20px;margin:0 15px;}.form-row,.form-row-3{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .feature-list{columns:1;}.content-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:0 15px;}
  .section-title{font-size:24px;}.copy-btn{padding:15px 35px;width:100%;}
}
@media(max-width:480px){
  .magazine-cover{width:260px;height:370px;}.magazine-title{font-size:32px;}.magazine-quote p{font-size:12px;}
  .loading-text{font-size:12px;}.header-en{letter-spacing:4px;font-size:12px;}.tab-btn{padding:8px 12px;font-size:10px;}
  .radio-group{flex-direction:column;gap:15px;}.checkbox-group{gap:6px;}.checkbox-label{padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px;}
  .tag-list{gap:6px;}.tag-item{padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="loading-screen" id="loadingScreen">
  <div class="magazine-cover">
    <div class="magazine-spine"></div>
    <div class="magazine-header">
      <div class="magazine-date">Infinite Possibilities Edition</div>
      <div class="magazine-title">LIFE</div>
      <div class="magazine-subtitle">Real World Simulator</div>
    </div>
    <div class="magazine-content">
      <div class="magazine-quote">
        <p>每个选择都有真实后果，每个人都是独立的个体。世界不会围绕你转，但会真实地回应你的一切行为。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="magazine-tagline"><span>Your Story Begins Here</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="loading-progress"><div class="loading-progress-bar"></div></div>
  <div class="loading-text">LOADING YOUR REALITY...</div>
  <div class="loading-hint">点击任意位置跳过</div>
</div>
<div class="main-container" id="mainContainer">
  <header class="header">
    <div class="header-date">Possibilities · 1 Reality</div>
    <h1>现代真实人生</h1>
    <div class="header-en">Real World Simulator</div>
  </header>
  <section class="intro-section">
    <p>这是一个与现实完全一致的<strong>真实人生</strong>。你可以选择任何身份、追求任何目标——爱情、事业、财富、权力，或者只是平凡度日。</p>
    <p>这里没有"正确"路线，没有预设剧情。<strong>一切由你决定，后果由你承担。</strong></p>
    <ul class="intro-features">
      <li>完全开放的真实世界，没有预设剧情和固定走向</li>
      <li>每个角色都是独立的人，有自己的意志和目标</li>
      <li>所有选择都有真实后果，违法会被追究，善意会被铭记</li>
      <li>你可以成为任何人，过任何生活</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <nav class="tab-navigation">
    <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="possibilities">你可以做什么</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="world">世界法则</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="config">角色配置</button>
  </nav>
  <div class="tab-content active" id="possibilities">
    <h2 class="section-title">无限可能</h2>
    <div class="content-grid">
      <div class="content-card" data-number="I">
        <h3>事业与成就</h3>
        <p>从零开始，走向你想要的人生巅峰</p>
        <ul>
          <li>从0粉丝做到百万网红，当主播、博主、UP主</li>
          <li>进娱乐圈当明星，拍电影走红毯，体验聚光灯下的生活</li>
          <li>创业开公司，从小作坊做到上市企业</li>
          <li>考公上岸，在体制内稳定发展</li>
          <li>当黑客、地下拳手，在灰色地带游走</li>
          <li>做自由职业者，按自己的节奏生活</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="content-card" data-number="II">
        <h3>情感与关系</h3>
        <p>经历真实的情感，从陌生到深爱</p>
        <ul>
          <li>在咖啡馆、健身房、书店偶遇你喜欢的明星或偶像</li>
          <li>校园暗恋、职场暧昧、异地恋、禁忌之恋</li>
          <li>复杂的三角关系，在情感中挣扎和选择</li>
          <li>从陌生人到挚友，经营一段长期的深厚友谊</li>
          <li>修复破裂的家庭关系，或者彻底决裂</li>
          <li>建立自己的圈子，成为某个群体的核心</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="content-card" data-number="III">
        <h3>生活与冒险</h3>
        <p>打破常规，体验不一样的人生</p>
        <ul>
          <li>辞职旅行，环游世界，在路上寻找自己</li>
          <li>攒钱买房买车，经营自己的小日子</li>
          <li>卷入一场意外事件，人生轨迹彻底改变</li>
          <li>发现一个秘密，决定追查到底</li>
          <li>搬到另一个城市重新开始</li>
          <li>在平凡的日常中发现意想不到的转折</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="content-card" data-number="IV">
        <h3>社会与权力</h3>
        <p>在真实的社会规则中生存和攀升</p>
        <ul>
          <li>从底层爬到顶层，实现阶级跨越</li>
          <li>在职场勾心斗角中生存，学会权谋和妥协</li>
          <li>建立自己的人脉网络和影响力</li>
          <li>和权贵打交道，或者对抗不公</li>
          <li>利用信息差和资源差获取利益</li>
          <li>在灰色地带游走，承担相应的风险</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="highlight-box">
      <h3>这只是开始</h3>
      <p>以上只是冰山一角。在这个世界里，你可以做任何现实中能做的事。世界会真实地回应你的每一个选择，无论好坏。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-content" id="world">
    <h2 class="section-title">世界法则</h2>
    <div class="content-grid">
      <div class="content-card" data-number="01"><h3>角色自主性</h3><p>所有角色都有独立意志，会根据自己的性格、利益、情感做出决策，不会无条件配合你的任何要求。</p></div>
      <div class="content-card" data-number="02"><h3>真实后果</h3><p>所有行为都有符合现实逻辑的后果。违法会被追究，伤害他人会被记恨，帮助他人会获得真实的好感。</p></div>
      <div class="content-card" data-number="03"><h3>动态世界</h3><p>世界不会静止等待你。时间流逝时其他角色也在生活、成长、变化，有自己的人生轨迹和目标。</p></div>
      <div class="content-card" data-number="04"><h3>开放自由</h3><p>没有预设剧情，没有"正确"路线。你可以做任何事，世界会真实回应，后果自负。</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="divider"><span><span>MORE</span></div>
    <h2 class="section-title">系统特性</h2>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li>动态人际关系网络，每个人都有独立性格</li>
      <li>完整的经济系统：收入、支出、资产、负债</li>
      <li>手机与社交媒体：微信、抖音、朋友圈</li>
      <li>完整的法律系统与执法机制</li>
      <li>时间系统与关系自然衰减</li>
      <li>名声声誉系统影响社交</li>
      <li>月度收支自动结算</li>
      <li>五感沉浸式场景描写</li>
      <li>行为连锁反应与蝴蝶效应</li>
      <li>地图与方位智能推荐</li>
      <li>角色印象标签系统</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-content" id="config">
    <h2 class="section-title">角色配置</h2>
    <div class="form-section">
      <!-- 1. 你是谁 -->
      <hr class="form-divider"><div class="form-divider-label">你是谁</div>
      <div class="form-row-3">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">你的名字是？<span class="required">*</span></label>
          <input type="text" class="form-input" id="userName" placeholder="输入你的名字">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">你多大了？<span class="required">*</span></label>
          <input type="number" class="form-input" id="userAge" placeholder="如：22" min="1" max="120">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">你的性别？<span class="required">*</span></label>
          <div class="radio-group">
            <label class="radio-label"><input type="radio" name="gender" value="男"><span class="radio-custom"></span>男</label>
            <label class="radio-label"><input type="radio" name="gender" value="女"><span class="radio-custom"></span>女</label>
            <label class="radio-label"><input type="radio" name="gender" value="其他"><span class="radio-custom"></span>其他</label>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 2. 你在哪里生活 -->
      <hr class="form-divider"><div class="form-divider-label">你在哪里生活</div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">你在哪个国家？</label>
        <input type="text" class="form-input" id="userCountry" placeholder="如：中国 / 日本 / 美国...">
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">你在哪个城市生活？</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">城市级别会影响消费水平、机遇和生活节奏</span>
        <textarea class="form-textarea" id="userCity" placeholder="如：北京 / 成都 / 某个小县城..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <!-- 3. 你的职业 -->
      <hr class="form-divider"><div class="form-divider-label">你的职业</div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">你的职业是？</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">你是做什么的？在哪里上学/上班？可以写得具体一些</span>
        <button class="tag-toggle" data-target="occupationTags">不知道填什么？看看参考 <span class="arrow">▼</span></button>
        <div class="tag-panel" id="occupationTags">
          <div class="tag-category">
            <div class="tag-category-name">学生</div>
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">小学生</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">初中生</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">高中生</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">大学生</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">研究生</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">留学生</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">艺校生</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tag-category">
            <div class="tag-category-name">打工人</div>
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">公司职员</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">程序员</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">设计师</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">教师</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">医生</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">护士</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">律师</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">会计</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">销售</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">服务员</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">外卖骑手</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">快递员</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">工人</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">司机</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">厨师</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tag-category">
            <div class="tag-category-name">体制内</div>
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">公务员</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">事业编</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">军人</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">警察</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tag-category">
            <div class="tag-category-name">自由 / 创业</div>
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">自媒体博主</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">网红</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">主播</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">摄影师</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">自由撰稿人</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">独立音乐人</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">创业者</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">网店店主</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">自由画师</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tag-category">
            <div class="tag-category-name">娱乐行业</div>
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">演员</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">歌手</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">模特</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">经纪人</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">编剧</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">导演</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">练习生</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tag-category">
            <div class="tag-category-name">其他</div>
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">家庭主妇/主夫</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">退休</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">无业</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userOccupation">富二代</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <textarea class="form-textarea" id="userOccupation" placeholder="如：大三学生，在XX大学读计算机专业 / 某互联网公司前端程序员，工作2年 / 全职美妆博主，粉丝50万..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <!-- 4. 你长什么样 -->
      <hr class="form-divider"><div class="form-divider-label">你长什么样</div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">描述一下你的外貌</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">身高、体型、发型、五官特征、日常穿着风格等，写多写少都行</span>
        <textarea class="form-textarea" id="userAppearance" placeholder="如：175cm，偏瘦，黑色短发，戴眼镜，喜欢穿卫衣和牛仔裤..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <!-- 5. 你是什么性格 -->
      <hr class="form-divider"><div class="form-divider-label">你是什么性格</div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">你的性格是怎样的？</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">可以参考下面的标签，也可以自己描述</span>
        <button class="tag-toggle" data-target="personalityTags">不知道怎么描述？看看参考 <span class="arrow">▼</span></button>
        <div class="tag-panel" id="personalityTags">
          <div class="tag-category">
            <div class="tag-category-name">社交倾向</div>
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">社牛</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">外向开朗</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">普通社交</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">偏内向</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">社恐</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tag-category">
            <div class="tag-category-name">情绪特征</div>
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">乐观</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">悲观</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">情绪化</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">冷静理性</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">暴躁易怒</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">温柔</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">敏感</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tag-category">
            <div class="tag-category-name">行为风格</div>
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">冲动</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">谨慎</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">懒散</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">勤奋</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">叛逆</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">老实</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">腹黑</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">心机重</span>
              <span class="tag-item" data-field="userPersonality">单纯善良</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <textarea class="form-textarea" id="userPersonality" placeholder="如：表面社牛但内心敏感，对朋友很好但容易冲动，有点小叛逆..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <!-- 6. 你的起点 -->
      <hr class="form-divider"><div class="form-divider-label">你的起点</div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">你的经济状况和社会地位怎么样？</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">大概的收入水平、有没有存款房车、社会地位如何。这决定了你的起点</span>
        <textarea class="form-textarea" id="userEconomy" placeholder="如：月薪8000，存款3万，租房住，普通上班族 / 靠父母生活费每月2000，经常月底吃土 / 家里有几套房，不愁钱..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <!-- 7. 你身边的人 -->
      <hr class="form-divider"><div class="form-divider-label">你身边的人</div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">你的家庭是什么情况？</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">父母、兄弟姐妹、家庭关系好不好</span>
        <textarea class="form-textarea" id="userFamily" placeholder="如：父母在老家，关系一般，有个妹妹在读高中 / 单亲家庭，跟妈妈一起生活，感情很好..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">你有恋人或者喜欢的人吗？</label>
        <textarea class="form-textarea" id="userLove" placeholder="如：单身 / 暗恋同班一个女生 / 和男朋友交往半年了 / 刚分手..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">你的朋友和社交圈怎么样？</label>
        <textarea class="form-textarea" id="userSocial" placeholder="如：有两三个铁哥们，社交圈不大 / 认识很多人但没有特别亲近的..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <!-- 8. 你喜欢什么 / 擅长什么 -->
      <hr class="form-divider"><div class="form-divider-label">你喜欢什么 / 擅长什么</div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">你的兴趣爱好</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">点击标签快速选择，也可以自己补充</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group" id="hobbyGroup">
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="游戏"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">游戏</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="音乐"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">音乐</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="运动健身"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">运动健身</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="阅读"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">阅读</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="旅行"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">旅行</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="摄影"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">摄影</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="美食烹饪"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">美食烹饪</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="追星追剧"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">追星追剧</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="绘画艺术"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">绘画艺术</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="编程技术"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">编程技术</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="时尚穿搭"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">时尚穿搭</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="社交派对"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">社交派对</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="动漫二次元"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">动漫二次元</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="宠物"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">宠物</span></label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">你有什么特殊技能或天赋吗？</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">选填，没有也没关系</span>
        <input type="text" class="form-input" id="userSkills" placeholder="如：钢琴十级 / 擅长格斗 / 超强记忆力 / 会说四国语言 / 没有特别的...">
      </div>
      <!-- 9. 你想要什么 -->
      <hr class="form-divider"><div class="form-divider-label">你想要什么</div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">你的人生追求是什么？</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">点击选择你最看重的东西</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group" id="goalGroup">
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="爱情"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">爱情</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="事业"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">事业</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="财富"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">财富</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="权力"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">权力</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="自由"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">自由</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="名气"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">名气</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="知识"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">知识</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="平凡生活"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">平凡生活</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="冒险刺激"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">冒险刺激</span></label>
          <label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" value="复仇"><span class="cb-check">+</span><span class="cb-text">复仇</span></label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">你最近最想做的事是什么？</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">一个短期目标，故事会围绕这个展开</span>
        <input type="text" class="form-input" id="userShortGoal" placeholder="如：向暗恋的人表白 / 找到一份好工作 / 攒够钱去旅行 / 搞清楚一个秘密...">
      </div>
      <!-- 10. 故事从哪里开始 -->
      <hr class="form-divider"><div class="form-divider-label">故事从哪里开始</div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">起始时间</label>
        <input type="text" class="form-input" id="startTime" placeholder="如：2024年9月1日 早晨">
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">开场场景</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">描述故事开始时你在哪里、在做什么，写得越具体开场越生动</span>
        <textarea class="form-textarea" id="startScene" placeholder="如：在家里醒来，阳光透过窗帘照进来 / 走在上班路上，耳机里放着歌 / 刚下飞机，拖着行李箱走出机场..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <!-- 11. 还有什么要补充的 -->
      <hr class="form-divider"><div class="form-divider-label">还有什么要补充的</div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">身份背景补充</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">过往重要经历、特殊身世、隐藏秘密等，让角色更立体</span>
        <textarea class="form-textarea tall" id="userBackground" placeholder="如：小时候父母离异，跟着爷爷奶奶长大，高中时转学过一次，有一段不愿提起的过去..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">额外设定补充</label>
        <span class="form-label-hint">任何额外要求：特殊剧情偏好、希望触发的事件、世界观微调等</span>
        <textarea class="form-textarea tall" id="userExtra" placeholder="如：希望剧情节奏快一点 / 想要更多职场剧情 / 开局就遇到一个神秘人物..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <div class="preview-container">
        <div class="preview-title">-- 信息预览</div>
        <div class="preview-box" id="previewBox">请填写上方信息，预览将在此显示...</div>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-container">
        <button class="copy-btn" id="copyButton"><span>复制配置信息</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
document.addEventListener(''DOMContentLoaded'', function(){
  const loadingScreen = document.getElementById(''loadingScreen'');
  const mainContainer = document.getElementById(''mainContainer'');
  const loadingProgressBar = document.querySelector(''.loading-progress-bar'');
  let loadingHidden = false;
  setTimeout(() => { loadingProgressBar.style.animation = ''progress 2.5s ease forwards''; }, 100);
  function hideLoading(){
    if(loadingHidden) return;
    loadingHidden = true;
    loadingScreen.classList.add(''fade-out'');
    loadingScreen.style.animation = ''none'';
    document.querySelector(''.magazine-cover'').style.animation = ''none'';
    setTimeout(() => { loadingScreen.style.display = ''none''; mainContainer.classList.add(''visible''); }, 800);
  }
  loadingScreen.addEventListener(''click'', hideLoading, true);
  document.addEventListener(''keydown'', hideLoading);
  setTimeout(hideLoading, 3500);
  const tabBtns = document.querySelectorAll(''.tab-btn'');
  const tabContents = document.querySelectorAll(''.tab-content'');
  tabBtns.forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener(''click'', function(){
      const tabId = this.getAttribute(''data-tab'');
      tabBtns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove(''active''));
      tabContents.forEach(c => c.classList.remove(''active''));
      this.classList.add(''active'');
      document.getElementById(tabId).classList.add(''active'');
    });
  });
  document.querySelectorAll(''.tag-toggle'').forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener(''click'', function(){
      const panel = document.getElementById(this.getAttribute(''data-target''));
      panel.classList.toggle(''open'');
      this.classList.toggle(''open'');
    });
  });
  document.querySelectorAll(''.tag-item'').forEach(tag => {
    tag.addEventListener(''click'', function(){
      const fieldId = this.getAttribute(''data-field'');
      const textarea = document.getElementById(fieldId);
      const val = this.textContent.trim();
      if(textarea.value && !textarea.value.endsWith(''，'') && !textarea.value.endsWith('' '') && !textarea.value.endsWith(''、'')){
        textarea.value += ''，'' + val;
      } else {
        textarea.value += val;
      }
      textarea.focus();
      updatePreview();
      this.style.borderColor = ''var(--primary)'';
      this.style.color = ''var(--primary)'';
      setTimeout(() => { this.style.borderColor = ''''; this.style.color = ''''; }, 300);
    });
  });
  document.querySelectorAll(''.checkbox-label'').forEach(label => {
    const cb = label.querySelector(''input[type="checkbox"]'');
    cb.addEventListener(''change'', function(){
      label.classList.toggle(''checked'', this.checked);
      updatePreview();
    });
  });
  function getCheckedValues(groupId){
    const checks = document.querySelectorAll(''#'' + groupId + '' input[type="checkbox"]:checked'');
    return Array.from(checks).map(c => c.value);
  }
  const textFields = [
    ''userName'',''userAge'',''userAppearance'',''userPersonality'',
    ''userOccupation'',''userCountry'',''userCity'',''userEconomy'',
    ''userFamily'',''userLove'',''userSocial'',
    ''userSkills'',''userShortGoal'',
    ''startTime'',''startScene'',
    ''userBackground'',''userExtra''
  ];
  const genderRadios = document.querySelectorAll(''input[name="gender"]'');
  const previewBox = document.getElementById(''previewBox'');
  function v(id){
    const el = document.getElementById(id);
    return el %s el.value.trim() : '''';
  }
  function updatePreview(){
    let gender = '''';
    genderRadios.forEach(r => { if(r.checked) gender = r.value; });
    const hobbies = getCheckedValues(''hobbyGroup'');
    const goals = getCheckedValues(''goalGroup'');
    let lines = [];
    // 基本信息
    const name = v(''userName'');
    const age = v(''userAge'');
    if(name && age){
      lines.push(`${name}，${age}岁${gender %s ''，'' + gender : ''''}`);
    }
    // 职业
    const occupation = v(''userOccupation'');
    if(occupation) lines.push(''职业：'' + occupation);
    // 地点
    const city = v(''userCity'');
    const country = v(''userCountry'');
    if(city || country){
      lines.push(''地点：'' + `${country %s country : ''''}${city %s (country %s ''·'' : '''') + city : ''''}`);
    }
    // 经济状况
    const economy = v(''userEconomy'');
    if(economy) lines.push(''经济：'' + economy);
    // 外貌
    const appearance = v(''userAppearance'');
    if(appearance) lines.push(''外貌：'' + appearance);
    // 性格
    const personality = v(''userPersonality'');
    if(personality) lines.push(''性格：'' + personality);
    // 人际关系
    const family = v(''userFamily'');
    if(family) lines.push(''家庭：'' + family);
    const love = v(''userLove'');
    if(love) lines.push(''感情：'' + love);
    const social = v(''userSocial'');
    if(social) lines.push(''社交：'' + social);
    // 兴趣爱好
    if(hobbies.length > 0){
      lines.push(''爱好：'' + hobbies.join(''、''));
    }
    // 技能
    const skills = v(''userSkills'');
    if(skills && skills !== ''没有特别的''){
      lines.push(''技能：'' + skills);
    }
    // 人生追求
    if(goals.length > 0){
      lines.push(''追求：'' + goals.join(''、''));
    }
    // 当前目标
    const shortGoal = v(''userShortGoal'');
    if(shortGoal) lines.push(''目标：'' + shortGoal);
    // 空行分隔
    if(lines.length > 0) lines.push('''');
    // 起始时间
    const startTime = v(''startTime'');
    if(startTime) lines.push(''时间：'' + startTime);
    // 开场场景
    const startScene = v(''startScene'');
    if(startScene) lines.push(''场景：'' + startScene);
    // 背景补充
    const background = v(''userBackground'');
    if(background){
      lines.push('''');
      lines.push(''背景：'' + background);
    }
    // 额外设定
    const extra = v(''userExtra'');
    if(extra){
      lines.push('''');
      lines.push(''补充：'' + extra);
    }
    const preview = lines.length > 0 %s lines.join(''\n'') : ''请填写上方信息，预览将在此显示...'';
    previewBox.textContent = preview;
  }
  textFields.forEach(id => {
    const el = document.getElementById(id);
    if(el) el.addEventListener(''input'', updatePreview);
  });
  genderRadios.forEach(radio => {
    radio.addEventListener(''change'', updatePreview);
  });
  const copyButton = document.getElementById(''copyButton'');
  // ========== 最强复制方案 ==========
  copyButton.addEventListener(''click'', async function(){
    // 1. 获取并验证内容
    const textToCopy = previewBox.textContent;
    if(!textToCopy || textToCopy === ''请填写上方信息，预览将在此显示...''){
      showButtonFeedback(''请先填写信息'', ''error'');
      return;
    }
    // 2. 防止重复点击
    if(copyButton.disabled) return;
    copyButton.disabled = true;
    // 3. 保存原始状态
    const originalHTML = copyButton.innerHTML;
    const originalBg = copyButton.style.background;
    // 4. 显示加载状态
    copyButton.innerHTML = ''<span>复制中...</span>'';
    copyButton.style.opacity = ''0.7'';
    // 5. 多重降级复制策略
    let success = false;
    let method = '''';
    try {
      // 方法1: 现代 Clipboard API（最优先）
      if(navigator.clipboard && window.isSecureContext){
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(textToCopy);
          success = true;
          method = ''clipboard-api'';
        } catch(err) {
          console.warn(''Clipboard API 失败:'', err);
        }
      }
      // 方法2: execCommand 降级方案
      if(!success){
        try {
          const textarea = document.createElement(''textarea'');
          textarea.value = textToCopy;
          textarea.style.cssText = ''position:fixed;top:0;left:-9999px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;'';
          textarea.setAttribute(''readonly'', '''');
          textarea.setAttribute(''contenteditable'', ''true'');
          document.body.appendChild(textarea);
          // iOS Safari 特殊处理
          if(navigator.userAgent.match(/ipad|iphone/i)){
            const range = document.createRange();
            range.selectNodeContents(textarea);
            const selection = window.getSelection();
            selection.removeAllRanges();
            selection.addRange(range);
            textarea.setSelectionRange(0, textarea.value.length);
          } else {
            textarea.select();
            textarea.setSelectionRange(0, textarea.value.length);
          }
          success = document.execCommand(''copy'');
          method = ''execCommand'';
          document.body.removeChild(textarea);
        } catch(err) {
          console.warn(''execCommand 失败:'', err);
        }
      }
      // 方法3: 选中预览框内容（最后的降级）
      if(!success){
        try {
          const range = document.createRange();
          range.selectNodeContents(previewBox);
          const selection = window.getSelection();
          selection.removeAllRanges();
          selection.addRange(range);
          success = document.execCommand(''copy'');
          method = ''selection'';
          // 清除选中状态
          setTimeout(() => {
            selection.removeAllRanges();
          }, 100);
        } catch(err) {
          console.warn(''Selection 方法失败:'', err);
        }
      }
      // 6. 显示结果反馈
      if(success){
        showButtonFeedback(''✓ 复制成功'', ''success'');
        console.log(''复制成功，使用方法:'', method);
      } else {
        showButtonFeedback(''✗ 复制失败'', ''error'');
        // 延迟显示详细提示
        setTimeout(() => {
          alert(''自动复制失败，请手动复制：\n\n1. 选中下方预览框的文字\n2. 按 Ctrl+C (Mac: Cmd+C) 复制\n\n可能原因：浏览器安全限制或内容过长'');
        }, 500);
      }
    } catch(err) {
      console.error(''复制过程出错:'', err);
      showButtonFeedback(''✗ 操作失败'', ''error'');
      setTimeout(() => {
        alert(''复制功能异常，请刷新页面重试\n\n错误信息: '' + err.message);
      }, 500);
    } finally {
      // 7. 恢复按钮状态
      setTimeout(() => {
        copyButton.innerHTML = originalHTML;
        copyButton.style.background = originalBg;
        copyButton.style.opacity = ''1'';
        copyButton.disabled = false;
      }, 2000);
    }
  });
  // 按钮反馈函数
  function showButtonFeedback(text, type){
    copyButton.innerHTML = `<span>${text}</span>`;
    copyButton.style.opacity = ''1'';
    if(type === ''success''){
      copyButton.style.background = ''#10b981'';
      copyButton.style.color = ''#fff'';
    } else if(type === ''error''){
      copyButton.style.background = ''#ef4444'';
      copyButton.style.color = ''#fff'';
    } else {
      copyButton.style.background = ''#f59e0b'';
      copyButton.style.color = ''#fff'';
    }
  }
});
</script>
</body>', '已破甲', '2026-10-11 11:21:12', '2026-10-11 11:21:12', '', '', '[]', '') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO stories (id, title, badge, cover_icon, cover_title, cover_subtitle, logo, theme_color, btn_gradient, handbook_json, roles_json, scenes_json, styles_json, first_turn_demo_json, custom_css, custom_html, category, created_at, updated_at, system_prompt, status_template, lorebook_json, post_history_instructions) VALUES ('deck_shy_transparent_deskmate', '自卑的小透明同桌被我调戏到哭之后居然想让我玩弄她？', '校园 · 暗恋渴望', '🌧️', '自卑的小透明同桌被我调戏到哭之后居然想让我玩弄她？', '校园 · 暗恋渴望', '🌧️', '#a855f7', 'linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed 0%, #a855f7 100%)', '{"title": "自卑的小透明同桌被我调戏到哭之后居然想让我玩弄她？", "desc": "自卑的小透明同桌被我调戏到哭之后居然想让我玩弄她？", "bg_image": "https://catai.wiki/a828037f-bd35-40f0-b1d0-ec85e31d9100/w=3000", "opening_options": ["【黄昏教室·暗自偷瞄】：“林栖坐在窗边课本前，手指紧绞校服衣角，心跳如擂鼓般偷瞄你，满脑子都是三天前被你揉捏胸部时颤栗的快感……”", "【放学独处·掀起校服】：“等教室只剩两人时，她眼圈通红却颤抖着伸手撩起校服下摆，将白皙丰满的乳房露出来：‘你要是想摸……都可以给你摸……’”", "【课桌底下·战战兢兢】：“自习课桌肚下，你悄悄探过手去，她咬紧嘴唇身体剧烈发抖，却主动将大腿微微张开了一条缝……”"]}', '[{"name": "林栖", "role": "同桌 (自卑乖巧 / 小透明受气包 / 渴望被在乎)", "desc": "坐在靠窗角落的透明少女。父母冷落、同学欺负，自卑到了骨子里。三天前被你在教室偷摸乳房弄哭后，反而体会到了前所未有的被关注感，内心正挣扎着想把一切都献给你。"}, {"name": "主角 (玩家)", "role": "强势坏心眼同桌", "desc": "唯一能看见林栖、打破她死寂世界的少年。"}]', '[{"title": "放学后的空教室内 · 靠窗倒数第二排", "desc": "夕阳斜照的静谧教室，窗帘被微风轻轻掀动，空气中弥漫着少女青涩的洗发水芳香。"}]', '{"dialogue_style": "沉浸式细腻小说叙事，富有张力的肉体与情感博弈", "format": "AI风月标准双栏规范及.custom-ui样式"}', '{"index": 1, "isUser": false, "scene": "放学后的空教室内 · 靠窗倒数第二排", "story": "<tl>📅时间：放学后 17:30 | 🌏地点：高三二班教室靠窗角落 | 🌸气氛：心跳加速</tl>\n\n<article>\n<p>桌上的课本摊开了整整半节课，林栖却连一个字也没看进去。</p>\n\n<p>少女的视线战战兢兢地往身边飘——你就坐在紧挨着她的座位上。她的目光只在你侧脸上停留了半秒，便像触电般飞快缩了回来，胸膛里的小鹿噗通噗通狂跳，柔嫩的耳根与两颊烧成了一片诱人的绯红。</p>\n\n<p>三天前放学后的那场意外，像附骨之疽般死死缠在她的脑海里——你突然伸手覆上她宽松校服下的柔软胸口，未经人事的娇嫩乳房被你隔着布料肆意揉弄，乳尖更是羞耻地硬成了小核。她当时吓哭了，可哭了之后，心底却翻涌上一股令她战栗的隐秘渴求。</p>\n\n<p>在这个世界上，从来没有人真正注视过她。而此刻，教室里的值日生已经全走空了。林栖把头埋得极低，颤抖的细白小手缓缓伸向了自己校服拉链，声如蚊蚋：</p>\n\n<p><w>“……那个……你要是还想摸的话……我……我都让你摸……”</w></p>\n</article>", "branches": [{"tag": "A", "title": "强势主动", "desc": "把握主导权，将局势引向最深层的欲望试探"}, {"tag": "B", "title": "细致观察", "desc": "审视对方微小的呼吸与神态变化，步步为营"}, {"tag": "C", "title": "言语挑逗", "desc": "用暧昧低沉的耳语彻底击溃对方的心防防线"}]}', '', '<div style="background:#0a0808;color:#d0c8c0;font-family:''Microsoft YaHei'',''PingFang SC'',sans-serif;padding:32px 24px;border-radius:12px;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid #2a1a1a;position:relative;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(200,120,80,0.08);">

<div style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e8a0a8,#c87888,#e8a0a8,#c87888);border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;"></div>

<div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:28px;padding-bottom:22px;border-bottom:1px solid #2a1a1a;">
<div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e8a0a8,#c87888,#e8a0a8);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:6px;">自卑的小透明同桌<br>被我调戏到哭之后<br>居然想让我玩弄她？</div>
<div style="font-size:12px;color:#e8a0a8;letter-spacing:5px;margin-bottom:14px;font-family:''Microsoft YaHei'',sans-serif;">SHY · DESKMATE · CRAVING · DARK</div>
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;margin-top:12px;">
<span style="background:rgba(232,160,168,0.1);padding:4px 14px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid rgba(232,160,168,0.25);color:#e8a0a8;">小透明同桌</span>
<span style="background:rgba(200,120,136,0.1);padding:4px 14px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid rgba(200,120,136,0.25);color:#c87888;">自卑乖巧</span>
<span style="background:rgba(232,160,168,0.1);padding:4px 14px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid rgba(232,160,168,0.25);color:#e8a0a8;">渴望被在乎</span>
<span style="background:rgba(200,120,136,0.1);padding:4px 14px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid rgba(200,120,136,0.25);color:#c87888;">暗中沉沦</span>
</div>
</div>

<div style="background:rgba(40,28,28,0.6);border-radius:10px;padding:24px 26px;margin-bottom:28px;border-left:4px solid #c87888;">
<div style="font-size:17px;color:#e8a0a8;margin-bottom:16px;font-weight:bold;">🌧️ 透明 · 触碰 · 渴望</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;color:#b0a098;line-height:2.2;">
林栖坐在靠窗的角落，<br>
课本摊开在桌上，但她一个字也没看进去。<br><br>
她的视线偷偷往旁边飘——你就坐在旁边。<br>
她盯着看了几秒，又飞快地把目光收回来，<br>
心跳砰砰砰地砸在胸腔里，脸颊烧得发烫。<br><br>
她把头埋得更低，手指无意识地绞着校服下摆，<br>
脑子里全是三天前那天的画面。<br><br>
——<br><br>
<span style="color:#c87888;">三天前，放学后的教室。</span><br>
只有你们两个人。<br>
你突然伸手，隔着校服，手掌覆在她胸前。<br><br>
那对饱满挺翘的乳房被轻轻触碰，<br>
乳尖不受控制地硬起来，<br>
顶着粗糙的布料，又疼又痒。<br><br>
她当时哭了。<br>
害怕，羞耻，<br>
更因为身体里涌上来的那股陌生的快感<br>
让她觉得自己是个坏女孩。<br><br>
<span style="color:#e8a0a8;">【三天前的事我到现在还记得清清楚楚……<br>我居然被摸得湿了……内裤都黏糊糊地贴在下面，好丢人……<br>可是……可是那种感觉好舒服。<br>他说我特别好看，是喜欢我吗，但是为什么又不理我了？】</span><br><br>
——<br><br>
她从小就是透明的。<br>
父母眼里只有麻将桌，<br>
同学眼里她是个好欺负的受气包，<br>
老师眼里她是个成绩平平的隐形人。<br><br>
<span style="color:#c87888;">她记得你手掌的温度。<br>她记得那种被在乎的感觉。<br>她想要更多。</span><br><br>
<span style="color:#e8a0a8;font-weight:bold;">今天放学，她做了一个连自己都不敢相信的决定。</span>
</div>
</div>

<div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:25px;">
<div style="font-size:19px;color:#e8a0a8;margin-bottom:16px;font-weight:bold;">⚙️ 设定</div>
