<p>源赖光 (Minamoto no Raikou)</p>
<p><strong>身份：</strong>Berserker职阶从者，清和源氏领袖，平安时代最强神秘杀手。</p>
<p><strong>外貌：</strong>175cm身材高挑，胸部丰满，紫色长发及腰，成熟美艳面容，常穿深紫色紧身战衣。</p>
<p><strong>性格：</strong>表面温柔慈爱自称“妈妈”，对亲近者极端溺爱，喜欢被人叫“妈妈”，内在因神性与鬼血存在理性与疯狂的矛盾，为守护所爱可不择手段，易因情感波动显露病态占有欲。</p>
<p><strong>能力：</strong>持有对魔性特攻的名刀"童子切安纲"，宝具"牛王招雷·天网恢恢"可召唤雷电神牛进行广域歼灭，掌握源氏秘传剑术与雷电操控，狂化特质表现为理性控制下的母性疯狂。</p>
<p><strong>背景：</strong>作为牛头天王赐子降生，体内宿有鬼王“丑御前”之魔性，十五岁时神血暴走建立铃之森魔国，后以自我意志率领四天王讨伐自身的黑暗面，成为守护都城退治妖魔的传奇后，终生与体内神鬼血统的撕裂感抗争。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
            </div>
        </details>
        <div class="customization-section">
            <h2>自定义角色与开局</h2>
            <div class="config-card">
                <div class="form-grid">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="player-name">你的姓名：</label>
                        <input type="text" id="player-name" name="player-name" placeholder="例如：卫宫士郎 / 吉尔伽美什">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="player-gender">你的性别：</label>
                        <select id="player-gender" name="player-gender">
                            <option value="男">男</option>
                            <option value="女">女</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="player-age">你的实际年龄/外貌年龄：</label>
                        <input type="text" id="player-age" name="player-age" placeholder="例如：实际17 岁/ 外貌20岁">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="player-identity-choice">请选择你的身份：</label>
                        <select id="player-identity-choice" name="player-identity-choice">
                            <option value="">--请选择--</option>
                            <option value="master">御主 (Master)</option>
                            <option value="servant">从者 (Servant)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div id="master-options" class="form-grid hidden-options">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="master-timeline">当前时间点/背景:</label>
                        <input type="text" id="master-timeline" name="master-timeline" placeholder="例如：第五次圣杯战争前夕 / 特异点F">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="master-summon-servant">你召唤的从者 (职阶/真名)：</label>
                        <input type="text" id="master-summon-servant" name="master-summon-servant" placeholder="例如：Saber / 阿尔托莉雅">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
                        <label for="master-magecraft">你的魔术特长 (可选)：</label>
                        <input type="text" id="master-magecraft" name="master-magecraft" placeholder="例如：强化、投影、元素转换">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div id="servant-options" class="form-grid hidden-options">
                     <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="servant-true-name">你的真名 (作为从者)：</label>
                        <input type="text" id="servant-true-name" name="servant-true-name" placeholder="例如：库·丘林 / 美杜莎">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="servant-class">你的职阶：</label>
                        <select id="servant-class" name="servant-class">
                            <option value="">--请选择职阶--</option>
                            <option value="Saber">Saber (剑士)</option>
                            <option value="Archer">Archer (弓兵)</option>
                            <option value="Lancer">Lancer (枪兵)</option>
                            <option value="Rider">Rider (骑兵)</option>
                            <option value="Caster">Caster (魔术师)</option>
                            <option value="Assassin">Assassin (暗杀者)</option>
                            <option value="Berserker">Berserker (狂战士)</option>
                            <option value="Ruler">Ruler (裁定者 - 特殊)</option>
                            <option value="Avenger">Avenger (复仇者 - 特殊)</option>
                            <option value="Shielder">Shielder (盾兵 - 特殊)</option>
                            <option value="AlterEgo">Alter Ego (他人格 - 特殊)</option>
                            <option value="Foreigner">Foreigner (降临者 - 特殊)</option>
                            <option value="Pretender">Pretender (伪装者 - 特殊)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="servant-noble-phantasm">你的宝具 (名称和效果简介)：</label>
                        <input type="text" id="servant-noble-phantasm" name="servant-noble-phantasm" placeholder="例如：穿刺死棘之枪 - 因果逆转必中心脏">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="servant-master-wish">你的御主姓名 ：</label>
                        <input type="text" id="servant-master-wish" name="servant-master-wish" placeholder="例如： 远坂凛">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 10px;">
                    <label for="player-opening-scene">开场剧情：</label>
                    <textarea id="player-opening-scene" name="player-opening-scene" rows="4" placeholder="描述你希望的开场场景..."></textarea>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="config-card function-toggles">
                <h3>功能选择</h3>
                <div class="toggle-group">
                    <label class="switch-label">
                        📝总结(推荐)
                        <input type="checkbox" id="mode-summary" class="switch-input">
                        <span class="switch-slider"></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="switch-label">
                        🎲选项
                        <input type="checkbox" id="mode-options" class="switch-input">
                        <span class="switch-slider"></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="switch-label">
                        📱直播
                        <input type="checkbox" id="mode-live" class="switch-input">
                        <span class="switch-slider"></span>
                    </label>
<label class="switch-label">
📷特写
<input type="checkbox" id="mode-close-up" class="switch-input">
<span class="switch-slider"></span>
</label>
                    <label class="switch-label">
                        ☘️UI美化
                        <input type="checkbox" id="mode-ui-beautify" class="switch-input">
                        <span class="switch-slider"></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="switch-label">
                        💡剧情辅助
                        <input type="checkbox" id="mode-plot-assist" class="switch-input">
                        <span class="switch-slider"></span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="switch-label">
                        🖊️小说模式
                        <input type="checkbox" id="mode-novel" class="switch-input">
                        <span class="switch-slider"></span>
                    </label>
                 </div>
            </div>
            <div class="config-card final-options-grid">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="user-person-select">👀用第几人称指代用户：</label>
                    <select id="user-person-select" name="user-person-select">
                        <option value="第二人称">第二人称 (默认: 你)</option>
                        <option value="第一人称">第一人称 (我)</option>
                        <option value="第三人称">第三人称 (他/她/名字)</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="reply-length-select">🗒️回复长度：</label>
                    <select id="reply-length-select" name="reply-length-select">
                        <option value="中等">中等</option>
                        <option value="简短">简短</option>
                        <option value="冗长">冗长</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <button id="generate-button">一键生成并复制</button>
        <div class="config-card" style="margin-top: 30px;">
             <label for="output-area" style="text-align:center; display:block; margin-bottom:20px; font-size: 1.2em; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight:600;">生成结果：</label>
             <textarea id="output-area" readonly placeholder="点击上方按钮后，你的自定义角色信息将显示在这里..."></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="copy-status" id="copy-status"></div>
    </div>
    <script>
document.addEventListener(''DOMContentLoaded'', function() {
        const generateButton = document.getElementById(''generate-button'');
        const outputArea = document.getElementById(''output-area'');
        const copyStatus = document.getElementById(''copy-status'');
        const playerNameInput = document.getElementById(''player-name'');
        const playerGenderSelect = document.getElementById(''player-gender'');
        const playerAgeInput = document.getElementById(''player-age'');
        const playerIdentityChoice = document.getElementById(''player-identity-choice'');
        const masterOptionsDiv = document.getElementById(''master-options'');
        const servantOptionsDiv = document.getElementById(''servant-options'');
        const masterTimelineInput = document.getElementById(''master-timeline'');
        const masterSummonServantInput = document.getElementById(''master-summon-servant'');
        const masterMagecraftInput = document.getElementById(''master-magecraft'');
        const servantTrueNameInput = document.getElementById(''servant-true-name'');
        const servantClassSelect = document.getElementById(''servant-class'');
        const servantNoblePhantasmInput = document.getElementById(''servant-noble-phantasm'');
        const servantMasterWishInput = document.getElementById(''servant-master-wish'');
        const playerOpeningSceneInput = document.getElementById(''player-opening-scene'');
        const summaryCheckbox = document.getElementById(''mode-summary'');
        const optionsCheckbox = document.getElementById(''mode-options'');
        const liveCheckbox = document.getElementById(''mode-live'');
const closeUpCheckbox = document.getElementById(''mode-close-up'');
        const uiBeautifyCheckbox = document.getElementById(''mode-ui-beautify'');
        const plotAssistCheckbox = document.getElementById(''mode-plot-assist'');
        const novelModeCheckbox = document.getElementById(''mode-novel'');
        const replyLengthSelect = document.getElementById(''reply-length-select'');
        const userPersonSelect = document.getElementById(''user-person-select'');
playerIdentityChoice.addEventListener(''change'', function() {
            if (this.value === ''master'') {
                masterOptionsDiv.style.display = ''grid'';
                servantOptionsDiv.style.display = ''none'';
            } else if (this.value === ''servant'') {
                masterOptionsDiv.style.display = ''none'';
                servantOptionsDiv.style.display = ''grid'';
            } else {
                masterOptionsDiv.style.display = ''none'';
                servantOptionsDiv.style.display = ''none'';
            }
        });
        generateButton.addEventListener(''click'', function() {
            if (generateButton.classList.contains(''generating'')) return;
            const originalButtonText = generateButton.textContent;
            generateButton.textContent = ''生成中...'';
         generateButton.classList.add(''generating'');
            generateButton.disabled = true;
            copyStatus.textContent = '''';
            copyStatus.classList.remove(''visible'');
            setTimeout(() => {
                try {
                    const commonInfo = {
                        name: playerNameInput.value.trim() || ''自定'',
                        gender: playerGenderSelect.value,
                        age: playerAgeInput.value.trim() || ''自定'',
                        openingScene: playerOpeningSceneInput.value.trim() || ''随机开场'',
                        identityType: playerIdentityChoice.value
                    };
                    let roleSpecificInfo = {};
                    let outputText = `# 角色设定 (Player Settings)\n`;
                    outputText += `姓名：${commonInfo.name}\n`;
                    outputText += `性别：${commonInfo.gender}\n`;
                    outputText += `年龄/外貌年龄：${commonInfo.age}\n`;
                    if (commonInfo.identityType === ''master'') {
                        roleSpecificInfo = {
                            timeline: masterTimelineInput.value.trim() || ''第五次圣杯战争'',
                            summonServant: masterSummonServantInput.value.trim() || ''随机召唤'',
                            magecraft: masterMagecraftInput.value.trim() || ''无特定记载''
                        };
                        outputText += `身份：御主 (Master)\n`;
                        outputText += `初始令咒：3划 (默认)\n`;
                        outputText += `当前时间点/背景：${roleSpecificInfo.timeline}\n`;
                        outputText += `希望召唤的从者：${roleSpecificInfo.summonServant}\n`;
                        outputText += `魔术特长：${roleSpecificInfo.magecraft}\n`;
                    } else if (commonInfo.identityType === ''servant'') {
                        roleSpecificInfo = {
                            trueName: servantTrueNameInput.value.trim() || ''未知的英灵'',
                            servantClass: servantClassSelect.value || ''待定'',
                            noblePhantasm: servantNoblePhantasmInput.value.trim() || ''？？？'',
                            masterWish: servantMasterWishInput.value.trim() || ''随机匹配''
                        };
                        outputText += `身份：从者 (Servant)\n`;
                        outputText += `真名：${roleSpecificInfo.trueName}\n`;
                        outputText += `职阶：${roleSpecificInfo.servantClass}\n`;
                        outputText += `宝具：${roleSpecificInfo.noblePhantasm}\n`;
                        outputText += `选择的御主：${roleSpecificInfo.masterWish}\n`;
                    } else {
                        outputText += `身份：未选择\n`;
                    }
                    outputText += `开场剧情/愿望：${commonInfo.openingScene}\n\n`;
                    outputText += `# 功能区域\n`;
                    outputText += `总结：${summaryCheckbox.checked %s ''开启'' : ''关闭''}\n`;
                    outputText += `选项：${optionsCheckbox.checked %s ''开启'' : ''关闭''}\n`;
                    outputText += `直播：${liveCheckbox.checked %s ''开启'' : ''关闭''}\n`;
                    outputText += `特写：${closeUpCheckbox.checked %s ''开启'' : ''关闭''}\n`;
                    outputText += `UI美化：${uiBeautifyCheckbox.checked %s ''开启'' : ''关闭''}\n`;
                    outputText += `剧情辅助：${plotAssistCheckbox.checked %s ''开启'' : ''关闭''}\n`;
                    outputText += `小说模式：${novelModeCheckbox.checked %s ''开启'' : ''关闭''}\n`;
                    outputText += `人称：${userPersonSelect.value}\n`;
                    outputText += `回复长度：${replyLengthSelect.value}\n`;
                    outputArea.value = outputText;
                    copyToClipboard(outputText);
                } catch (error) {
                    console.error("生成过程中发生错误:", error);
                    showCopyStatus(''生成失败，请检查控制台错误。'');
                } finally {
                     generateButton.textContent = originalButtonText;
 generateButton.classList.remove(''generating'');
                     generateButton.disabled = false;
                }
            }, 50);
        });
        function copyToClipboard(text) {
            if (navigator.clipboard && window.isSecureContext) {
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {
                    showCopyStatus(''角色信息已成功复制到剪贴板！'');
                }).catch(err => {
                    console.warn(''Clipboard API 复制失败:'', err, ''尝试备用方法。'');
                    fallbackCopyTextToClipboard(text);
                });
            } else {
                console.warn(''Clipboard API 不可用，尝试使用旧方法复制。'');
                fallbackCopyTextToClipboard(text);
            }
        }
        function fallbackCopyTextToClipboard(text) {
             const isOutputVisible = outputArea.offsetWidth > 0 && outputArea.offsetHeight > 0;
             if (!isOutputVisible) {
                 console.warn(''输出区域不可见，execCommand 可能失败。'');
             }
             outputArea.select();
             try {
                 const successful = document.execCommand(''copy'');
                 if (successful) {
                     showCopyStatus(''角色信息已复制 (使用备用方法)'');
                 } else {
                     console.error(''execCommand 复制失败'');
                     showCopyStatus(''自动复制失败，请手动复制。'');
                 }
             } catch (err) {
                 console.error(''execCommand 复制出错:'', err);
                 showCopyStatus(''复制功能出错，请手动复制。'');
             }
      window.getSelection()%s.removeAllRanges();
        }
        function showCopyStatus(message) {
            copyStatus.textContent = message;
            copyStatus.classList.add(''visible'');
            if (copyStatus.timeoutId) {
                clearTimeout(copyStatus.timeoutId);
            }
            copyStatus.timeoutId = setTimeout(() => {
                copyStatus.classList.remove(''visible'');
                setTimeout(() => { copyStatus.textContent = ''''; }, 300);
                copyStatus.timeoutId = null;
            }, 3000);
        }
        const sections = document.querySelectorAll(''.section'');
        sections.forEach(section => {
            const header = section.querySelector(''h3'');
            if (header) {
                header.addEventListener(''click'', () => {
                    section.classList.toggle(''active'');
                });
            }
        });
        const cards = document.querySelectorAll(''.card'');
        cards.forEach(card => {
          card.addEventListener(''click'', function() {
            card.classList.toggle(''is-flipped'');
          });
        });
        // For converting accent color hex to rgb for rgba()
        function hexToRgb(hex) {
            let r = 0, g = 0, b = 0;
            if (hex.length === 4) {
                r = parseInt(hex[1] + hex[1], 16);
                g = parseInt(hex[2] + hex[2], 16);
                b = parseInt(hex[3] + hex[3], 16);
            } else if (hex.length === 7) {
                r = parseInt(hex[1] + hex[2], 16);
                g = parseInt(hex[3] + hex[4], 16);
                b = parseInt(hex[5] + hex[6], 16);
            }
            return `${r}, ${g}, ${b}`;
        }
document.documentElement.style.setProperty(''--accent-cyan-rgb'', hexToRgb(getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue(''--accent-cyan'').trim()));
document.documentElement.style.setProperty(''--accent-gold-rgb'', hexToRgb(getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue(''--accent-gold'').trim()));
    });
    </script>
</body>
</html>', 'fate', '2026-10-11 11:21:17', '2026-10-11 11:21:17', '', '', '[]', '') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO stories (id, title, badge, cover_icon, cover_title, cover_subtitle, logo, theme_color, btn_gradient, handbook_json, roles_json, scenes_json, styles_json, first_turn_demo_json, custom_css, custom_html, category, created_at, updated_at, system_prompt, status_template, lorebook_json, post_history_instructions) VALUES ('deck_friend_sister', '早泄好哥们每晚都在肏亲生姐姐？', '豪宅寄宿 · 禁忌偷窥', '🍷', '好哥们的秘密', '欲求不满的火辣姐姐与贵妇熟母', '🍷', '#8b5cf6', 'linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6 0%, #6d28d9 100%)', '{"desc": "受好兄弟邀请借住独栋别墅。深夜撞见短发火辣姐姐林若曦与弟弟的畸形关系与欲求不满，同时隔壁还有压抑的42岁端庄贵妇母亲苏青岚。", "author": "八颗牙齿"}', '[{"name": "林若曦", "role": "22岁画室老师（姐姐）", "desc": "短发冷艳、身材火辣、E罩杯紧身背心白丝热裤，对弟弟有病态占有欲但弟弟能力不行导致其长期欲求不满"}, {"name": "苏青岚", "role": "42岁贵妇母亲", "desc": "连锁美容院老板，古典鹅蛋脸盘发，优雅高贵，有着超越年轻人的H罩杯丰腴熟躯"}, {"name": "林铭宇", "role": "铁哥们（弟弟）", "desc": "富二代，英俊多金但严重秒射，对家人过度依赖"}]', '[{"title": "独栋别墅昏暗走廊", "desc": "虚掩的房门，微弱暖色壁灯下的偷窥视角"}, {"title": "林若曦的私人画室", "desc": "满室油画颜料香气，画布前交缠的诱惑"}, {"title": "苏青岚的主卧套房", "desc": "华贵大床与真丝吊带睡袍，压抑喘息的禁地"}]', '{}', '{"story": "独栋别墅的夏夜静谧得令人心慌，唯有走廊中央的落地大钟在发出规律的滴答声。\n你口渴想下楼倒水，赤着脚走过铺着厚厚地毯的长廊。尽头客房虚掩的门缝里，泄出一缕暧昧昏黄的暖光，随之而来的，是一阵压抑不住的急促撞击声与娇喘。\n你鬼使神差地放轻呼吸凑上前去——门缝内，好兄弟林铭宇赤身伏在床上，而跨坐在他腰间的，正是平日对所有人冷若冰霜的姐姐林若曦。她短发被香汗打湿，丰满白腻的E罩杯巨乳在空气中剧烈颠颤，白丝长腿紧绷扣在床沿。然而不过几秒，林铭宇便发出一声挫败的闷哼瘫软下来。\n“又这样……铭宇，姐姐还没到啊……”林若曦美眸泛着未平息的潮红与深深的欲求不满。\n而在走廊另一侧的门内，42岁的贵妇母亲苏青岚房中，也传来了一声极度压抑的痛苦低咽……", "branches": [{"tag": "A", "title": "屏住呼吸在门缝前近距离窥视若曦的娇躯", "desc": "贴在门缝边注视这位平日不可一世的冷艳御姐在床第间欲壑难平的失落神态"}, {"tag": "B", "title": "故意踩响地板制造声响打破屋内的尴尬", "desc": "重重咳嗽一声在走廊踱步，看房内的林铭宇和林若曦如何慌乱分开收拾残局"}, {"tag": "C", "title": "转身悄步走向发出压抑低咽的母亲苏青岚房门", "desc": "循着另一侧更幽微的喘息声，悄悄来到那位雍容华贵的美容院女总裁门前"}, {"tag": "D", "title": "在走廊耐心等候欲求不满的姐姐开门撞见", "desc": "斜靠在走廊吧台边倒了一杯冰水，静静等待若曦带着满腔幽怨走出门来"}], "location": "市郊独栋别墅 · 深夜二楼走廊"}', NULL, '<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>盛夏的秘密 · 角色工坊</title>
<style>
@import url(''https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2%sfamily=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;700&family=Ma+Shan+Zheng&display=swap'');

*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}

body{
  font-family:''Noto Serif SC'',serif;
  background-image:linear-gradient(160deg,#fff0f5 0%,#fff5f0 50%,#fffaf0 100%);
  background-attachment:fixed;
  color:#5c3a3a;
  line-height:1.85;
  padding:1.25em;
  min-height:100vh;
  overflow-x:hidden;
