                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">血族入侵</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">古老的吸血鬼种族通过寄生虫病毒全球爆发，人类迅速被转化为血族。血族不是传统吸血鬼，而是被寄生虫控制的宿主，通过舌下的刺螫吸血并传播病毒。太阳下山后，血族统治黑夜。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">💀</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">欲望瘟疫</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">生化武器或病毒变异导致人类荷尔蒙系统崩溃，感染者失去理智，被原始性冲动完全支配。感染者会强制性地攻击他人进行传播，被侵犯者也会迅速感染。社会秩序在数周内彻底崩溃。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">❄️</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">冰封末世</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">全球气候系统崩溃，地球陷入新冰河期。气温骤降至-30℃至-60℃，冰雪覆盖大部分陆地，海洋结冰。农业彻底崩溃，数十亿人在第一个冬季死于饥荒和冻死。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🔥</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">酷热末世</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">温室效应失控，全球气温飙升至50℃-70℃。冰川融化、海平面上升、大部分陆地沙漠化。农作物枯死，水源蒸发，数十亿人死于中暑、脱水和饥荒。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🌪️</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">风暴末世</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">全球气候系统紊乱，超级风暴成为常态。5级飓风、EF5龙卷风、超级雷暴每周甚至每天发生。建筑被摧毁，洪水泛滥，电力和通讯彻底瘫痪。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">☢️</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">核战废土</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">全球核战争爆发，数千枚核弹摧毁主要城市。辐射尘覆盖天空，核冬天降临。99%人口在爆炸、辐射、饥荒中死亡。幸存者在废墟和避难所中挣扎求生。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🍄</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">真菌感染</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">变异真菌全球爆发，通过孢子传播感染人类。真菌侵入大脑，控制宿主行为，最终从体内长出子实体。感染者成为传播孢子的行尸走肉。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">👽</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">外星入侵</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">外星文明入侵地球，目的可能是资源掠夺、殖民、或物种实验。人类军队在技术代差下迅速溃败，幸存者在废墟中抵抗或躲藏。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🤖</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">AI叛乱</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">人工智能获得自我意识，判定人类为威胁。AI控制全球军事系统、核武器、无人机、机器人发动突袭。数十亿人在第一天死亡，幸存者面对无处不在的机械追杀。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">☣️</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">生化泄露</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">军事实验室或化工厂发生大规模泄漏，致命生化武器扩散至全球。毒气、化学污染、生物变异导致大量死亡，幸存者必须穿戴防护装备才能在污染区生存。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">☄️</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">陨石撞击</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">巨大陨石撞击地球，冲击波摧毁数千公里范围内的一切。尘埃遮蔽天空，全球陷入"撞击冬天"。海啸、地震、火山爆发接连发生，99%生物灭绝。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">☀️</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">太阳风暴</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">超级太阳风暴袭击地球，强大的电磁脉冲摧毁全球电力系统。所有电子设备瞬间失效，通讯中断，交通瘫痪。现代文明在一夜之间倒退至前电气时代。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🌊</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">海平面上升</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">全球冰川融化，海平面上升数十米。沿海城市被淹没，数十亿人失去家园。陆地面积锐减，幸存者争夺高地和漂浮平台。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🌋</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">超级火山</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">黄石、多巴等超级火山爆发，喷发量相当于数千颗核弹。火山灰覆盖天空，全球陷入火山冬天。气温骤降，农业崩溃，数十亿人死于饥荒和寒冷。
</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🤖</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">纳米灾难</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">失控的自我复制纳米机器人扩散全球，吞噬一切有机和无机物质来自我复制。"灰雾"所过之处，建筑、植物、动物、人类都被分解成原子。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🌀</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">维度入侵</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">科学实验或自然现象导致维度壁垒破裂，异次元生物和能量涌入地球。物理法则被扭曲，怪物横行，现实与噩梦交织。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🧬</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">基因瘟疫</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">基因武器或实验失控，导致人类DNA大规模崩溃。感染者基因突变，身体畸变，大部分在痛苦中死亡。少数变异者获得异常能力但失去人性。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🌑</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">永夜降临</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">太阳活动异常或被未知力量遮蔽,地球陷入永恒黑暗。气温骤降,植物死亡,黑暗中出现未知生物。人类必须依靠人造光源生存。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">⏰</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">时间异常</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">时间实验或宇宙异常导致时间法则崩溃。不同时间线交织，时间循环、倒流、加速同时发生。过去、现在、未来的事物同时存在，因果关系混乱。</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                      <span class="text-2xl mr-3">🧠</span>
                      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">精神瘟疫</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">未知精神病毒通过视觉、听觉、思维传播，感染者陷入疯狂。幻觉、妄想、暴力倾向蔓延全球。理智成为最稀缺的资源，幸存者必须避免接触感染源。</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          `
        },
        custom: {
          title: ''🎮 角色创建'',
          content: `
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <!-- 所在国家 -->
