<!-- ========== 设置弹窗 ========== -->
<div class="setup-overlay" id="setupOverlay">
<div class="setup-panel">
<div class="setup-header">
<span class="setup-header-title" id="setupTitle">✦ 角色设定</span>
<span class="setup-header-step" id="setupStepIndicator">1 / 5</span>
</div>
<div class="setup-body" id="setupBody">

<div class="setup-step active" id="setupStep1">
<div class="setup-name-label">输入你的姓名：</div>
<input type="text" class="setup-name-input" id="playerNameInput" placeholder="留空则默认：藤场 悠真" maxlength="20" autocomplete="off">
</div>

<div class="setup-step" id="setupStep2">
<div class="mode-select-title">选择你的游玩风格</div>
<div class="mode-cards">
<div class="mode-card" id="modePure"><div class="mode-card-flip"><div class="mode-card-inner"><div class="mode-card-front"><img src="https://miha.wiki/0TqZNl.png" draggable="false"></div><div class="mode-card-back"><img src="https://miha.wiki/Dq5rar.png" draggable="false"></div></div></div><div class="mode-card-label">纯爱模式</div><div class="mode-card-desc">该模式下无任何NTR角色与剧情出现。你可以安心的享受独属于你与妹妹的纯爱故事。纯爱妹真的真的超可爱的！<br>【该模式有专属自拍照片和视频】</div></div>
<div class="mode-card" id="modeNTR"><div class="mode-card-flip"><div class="mode-card-inner"><div class="mode-card-front"><img src="https://miha.wiki/3YdlFa.png" draggable="false"></div><div class="mode-card-back"><img src="https://miha.wiki/0apPTc.png" draggable="false"></div></div></div><div class="mode-card-label">NTR风险模式</div><div class="mode-card-desc">该模式下存在NTR风险的角色与剧情出现。妹妹会极度降智，比较白给。玩家可以自行抉择干扰或者放任不管。<br>【该模式有专属超大量额外CG】</div></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="setup-step" id="setupStep3">
<div class="mode-select-title">选择债务难度</div>
<div class="mode-cards">
<div class="mode-card" id="debtEasy"><div class="mode-card-flip"><div class="mode-card-inner"><div class="mode-card-front"><img src="https://miha.wiki/68B2xX.png" draggable="false"></div><div class="mode-card-back"><img src="https://miha.wiki/xwKZJs.png" draggable="false"></div></div></div><div class="mode-card-label">简单模式</div><div class="mode-card-desc">你将会拥有更少的日支出和债务，能够更加轻松的与你的妹妹愉快生活。</div></div>
<div class="mode-card" id="debtHard"><div class="mode-card-flip"><div class="mode-card-inner"><div class="mode-card-front"><img src="https://miha.wiki/CICcfv.png" draggable="false"></div><div class="mode-card-back"><img src="https://miha.wiki/N5iA6D.png" draggable="false"></div></div></div><div class="mode-card-label">困难模式</div><div class="mode-card-desc">困难模式，债务更多，还款压力更大。需要多想办法赚钱，比较具有挑战性。</div></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="setup-step" id="setupStep4">
<div class="mode-select-title">选择初始好感度（上限500）</div>
<div class="mode-cards">
<div class="mode-card" id="favor50"><div class="mode-card-flip"><div class="mode-card-inner"><div class="mode-card-front"><img src="https://miha.wiki/dhsNrB.png" draggable="false"></div><div class="mode-card-back"><img src="https://miha.wiki/XwDbFq.png" draggable="false"></div></div></div><div class="mode-card-label">初始好感 50</div><div class="mode-card-desc">你对家以及她的付出她看在眼里，她会愿意帮你简单进行性处理。</div></div>
<div class="mode-card" id="favor300"><div class="mode-card-flip"><div class="mode-card-inner"><div class="mode-card-front"><img src="https://miha.wiki/SrKtIQ.png" draggable="false"></div><div class="mode-card-back"><img src="https://miha.wiki/LW4iMl.png" draggable="false"></div></div></div><div class="mode-card-label">初始好感 300</div><div class="mode-card-desc">已对你产生类别样情感与需求，会主动与你发生性​关​系。（但目前尚未发生）</div></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="setup-step" id="setupStep5">
<div class="setup-info-group">
<div class="setup-info-label">玩家姓名</div>
<input type="text" class="setup-info-input" id="infoName" maxlength="20" autocomplete="off" placeholder="留空则默认：藤场 悠真">
</div>
<div class="setup-info-group">
<div class="setup-info-label">游玩模式</div>
<div class="setup-info-select-wrapper"><select class="setup-info-select" id="infoModeSelect"><option value="pure">纯爱模式</option><option value="ntr">NTR风险模式</option></select></div>
</div>
<div class="setup-info-group">
<div class="setup-info-label">债务难度</div>
<div class="setup-info-select-wrapper"><select class="setup-info-select" id="infoDebtSelect"><option value="easy">简单模式</option><option value="hard">困难模式</option></select></div>
</div>
<div class="setup-info-group">
<div class="setup-info-label">初始好感度</div>
<div class="setup-info-select-wrapper"><select class="setup-info-select" id="infoFavorSelect"><option value="50">初始好感 50</option><option value="300">初始好感 300</option></select></div>
</div>

<div class="setup-divider"></div>

<div class="setup-option-group">
<div class="setup-option-title">回复字数</div>
<div class="setup-radio-group">
<label class="setup-radio-item"><input type="radio" name="replyWords" value="1000"><div class="setup-radio-label"><span class="setup-radio-value">1000字</span><span class="setup-radio-hint">消耗降低，不爱抢话，AI注意力更集中。</span></div></label>
<label class="setup-radio-item"><input type="radio" name="replyWords" value="1500" checked><div class="setup-radio-label"><span class="setup-radio-value">1500字</span><span class="setup-radio-hint">标准配置，与各模型相性不错。</span></div></label>
<label class="setup-radio-item"><input type="radio" name="replyWords" value="3000"><div class="setup-radio-label"><span class="setup-radio-value">3000字</span><span class="setup-radio-hint">字数更多。但部分模型不生效。</span></div></label>
</div>
</div>

<div class="setup-option-group">
<div class="setup-option-header"><div><div class="setup-option-title">思维链</div><div class="setup-option-desc">开启会增加消耗，但是剧情、行为、数值变化、插图更加稳定。相当于输出内容之前，AI自己先过一遍脑子，模型越聪明效果越好。十分推荐开启。</div></div><label class="setup-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="toggleThinkChain" checked><span class="setup-toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
</div>

<div class="setup-option-group">
<div class="setup-option-header"><div><div class="setup-option-title">防神化防绝望</div><div class="setup-option-desc">防止角色和剧情走向崩溃。推荐开启。</div></div><label class="setup-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="toggleAntiMyth" checked><span class="setup-toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
</div>

<div class="setup-option-group">
<div class="setup-option-header"><div><div class="setup-option-title">防抢话</div><div class="setup-option-desc">可以防止AI替主角做出行动或做决定，但是缺点是主角很可能变成哑巴。开不开自行斟酌。</div></div><label class="setup-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="toggleAntiTalk"><span class="setup-toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
</div>

<div class="setup-option-group">
<div class="setup-option-header"><div><div class="setup-option-title">记忆区</div><div class="setup-option-desc">一个简单的记忆区，默认开启，AI会更好记住对话和设定。选择关闭的话则建议使用风月自带的记忆增强或者使用北极星记忆区MOD。</div></div><label class="setup-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="toggleMemory" checked><span class="setup-toggle-slider"></span></label></div>
</div>

<div class="scroll-hint-bar" id="scrollHintBar">▼ 请滑动到底部以解锁开始游戏 ▼</div>
</div>

</div>
<div class="setup-footer" id="setupFooter"></div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- ========== 确认弹窗 ========== -->
<div class="confirm-overlay" id="confirmOverlay">
<div class="confirm-box">
<span class="confirm-icon">📋</span>
<div class="confirm-title">确认开始游戏？</div>
<div class="confirm-desc">请确认所有信息已填写完毕。<br>开始后设定将无法更改。</div>
<div class="confirm-actions">
<button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" id="confirmCancel">返回修改</button>
<button class="btn btn-sm" id="confirmStart">确认开始</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- ========== R18 警告弹窗 ========== -->
<div class="confirm-overlay" id="r18WarningOverlay">
<div class="confirm-box">
<span class="confirm-icon">⚠️</span>
<div class="confirm-title" style="color: #ff6b6b;">内容提醒</div>
<div class="confirm-desc" style="color: #ff6b6b; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px;">
接下来内容会有R18音效<br>请调整音量或佩戴耳机，避免社死。<br>部分移动端机型有音效BUG，作者修不动辣！</div>
<div class="confirm-actions">
<button class="btn btn-sm disabled" id="r18StartBtn">开始游戏 (5s)</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- ========== NTR风险模式警告弹窗 ========== -->
<div class="confirm-overlay" id="ntrWarningOverlay">
<div class="confirm-box">
<img src="https://miha.wiki/WD5iHt.png" style="max-width:85%; max-height:220px; border-radius:10px; margin-bottom:16px; border:1.5px solid rgba(255,107,157,0.3);" alt="NTR警告">
<div class="confirm-title" style="color:#ff6b6b; font-size:18px;">⚠️AI的NTR剧情都比较弱智！<br>确定哦？ 别玩了又不高兴。</div>
<div class="confirm-desc" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size:14px; margin-top:8px;">选择NTR风险模式后，会有危险角色接近紫乃。<br>你确定要继续吗？</div>
<div class="confirm-actions">
<button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" id="ntrCancel">返回</button>
<button class="btn btn-sm" id="ntrConfirm">下一步</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>

