    <!-- Collapsible Sections -->
    <div class="collapsible-container">
        <div class="collapsible-item">
            <button class="collapsible-trigger">
                <span class="trigger-title"><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i><span>基础说明</span></span>
                <span class="trigger-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapsible-content">
                <p><strong>💫 降低Token消耗的方法：</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>💫在设置中调低记忆范围（建议4或6）</li>
                    <li>💫更换低系数模型（质量自测）</li>
                    <li>💫关闭部分美化或辅助功能</li>
                    <li>💫定期将长期总结区内容挪到自定义配置的提示词里</li>
                    <li>💫减少使用的MOD数量</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapsible-item">
            <button class="collapsible-trigger">
                <span class="trigger-title"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i><span>怀疑度设定</span></span>
                <span class="trigger-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapsible-content">
                <p>🔍 <strong>安全 (0%-20%)</strong>：室友对你完全信任，不会在意你的小异常。</p>
                <p>🔍 <strong>疑惑 (21%-50%)</strong>：注意到你的反常，但会自行找理由解释过去。</p>
                <p>🔍 <strong>警惕 (51%-80%)</strong>：开始有意或无意地试探你，如观察你换衣、在你洗澡时有意靠近等等。</p>
                <p>🔍 <strong>确定 (81%-100%)</strong>：内心基本确信你的秘密，可能寻找证据或直接对质。</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 12px; color: var(--accent);"><strong>💡 降低怀疑度的方法：</strong>以自然的女性姿态相处、主动解释可疑之处、适时展现柔弱或委屈的一面。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapsible-item">
            <button class="collapsible-trigger">
                <span class="trigger-title"><i class="fas fa-cogs"></i><span>小功能说明</span></span>
                <span class="trigger-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapsible-content">
                <p><strong>📝 总结</strong> — 在底部生成剧情发展进程（记忆区），可编辑修改或将重要部分复制到自定义配置内。指令："开启总结" / "关闭总结"</p>
                <p><strong>🎲 选项</strong> — 在底部生成三个选项供选择（懒人模式）。指令："开启选项" / "关闭选项"</p>
                <p><strong>📱 直播</strong> — 底部生成直播间弹幕（来自高维观众的调侃），不影响剧情。指令："开启直播" / "关闭直播"</p>
                <p><strong>👀 人称视角</strong> — 改变AI对用户的代称（第一人称"我" / 第二人称"你" / 第三人称"他/她"）。指令："改成第一人称" 等</p>
                <p><strong>📷 画面特写</strong> — 每次回复以微观特写镜头描写具体细节。指令："开启特写" / "关闭特写"</p>
                <p><strong>☘️ UI美化</strong> — 使状态栏UI更美观，消耗略增。指令："开启美化" / "关闭美化"</p>
                <p><strong>📖 小说模式</strong> — AI以网络小说风格创作，更多NPC戏份（可能代替玩家反应，慎用）。指令："开启小说模式" / "关闭小说模式"</p>
                <p><strong>💡 剧情辅助</strong> — 想象力受限时提供剧情发展建议。指令："开启剧情辅助" / "关闭剧情辅助"</p>
                <p><strong>🖊️ 回复长度</strong> — 简短(500字以下) / 中等(700-1200字) / 冗长(1500字以上)。指令："回复长度中等"</p>
                <p><strong>😈 雌小鬼吐槽</strong> — 底部出现AI吐槽角色，用阴阳怪气语调嘲讽（受不了请勿开启）。指令："开启雌小鬼吐槽" / "关闭雌小鬼吐槽"</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collapsible-item">
            <button class="collapsible-trigger">
                <span class="trigger-title"><i class="fas fa-book-open"></i><span>自定义配置说明</span></span>
                <span class="trigger-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapsible-content">
<p>⚙️位置在右上角，可填入你自定义的设定和故事进程(若创建新对话，则必须检查配置中是否有之前遗留的设定)。</p>
<p>⚙️【前置词/后置词】：将你填写在里面的内容，每次附加在你发送给ai消息的前面/后面。例如输出格式总是出错，那你可以在后置词里写[注意遵守输出格式]</p>
<p>⚙️【主提示词】：主要填写设定的区域，大部分设定只需填写在此即可，例如你可以把自己的信息、故事的发展进程、重要事件填写在此。</p>
<p>⚙️【世界书】：当对话中触发了你设置的关键词后，ai才能读取到你写在里面的设定。此功能非常灵活，用于节省积分，我的所有功能都是以世界书形式触发。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Custom Hub -->
    <div class="custom-hub">
        <div class="hub-header">
            <h2><i class="fas fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> 自定义角色</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-tabs">
            <button class="hub-tab-btn active" data-tab="1"><i class="fas fa-users"></i> 角色设定</button>
            <button class="hub-tab-btn" data-tab="2"><i class="fas fa-sliders"></i> 功能设定</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Tab 1: Character Settings -->
        <div id="tab-panel-1" class="hub-content-panel active">
            <h3 class="section-title"><i class="fas fa-user"></i> 你的信息</h3>
            <div class="form-section">
                <div class="form-grid">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label><i class="fas fa-signature"></i> 姓名</label>
                        <input type="text" class="user-input" data-key="userName" placeholder="你的角色名">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label><i class="fas fa-cake-candles"></i> 年龄</label>
                        <input type="text" class="user-input" data-key="userAge" placeholder="角色年龄">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label><i class="fas fa-star"></i> 外貌特征</label>
                        <input type="text" class="user-input" data-key="userAppearance" placeholder="外貌描述">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label><i class="fas fa-heart"></i> 性格特点</label>
                        <input type="text" class="user-input" data-key="userPersonality" placeholder="性格描述">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label><i class="fas fa-palette"></i> 兴趣爱好</label>
                        <input type="text" class="user-input" data-key="userHobby" placeholder="喜欢的活动">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label><i class="fas fa-shield"></i> 隐藏秘密</label>
                        <input type="text" class="user-input" data-key="userSecret" placeholder="角色的秘密设定">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3 class="section-title"><i class="fas fa-users"></i> 室友设定</h3>
            <div class="roommate-cards">
                <div class="roommate-card" data-roommate="1">
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-bed"></i> 室友一</h3>
                    <p class="status" id="roommate1Status">尚未设定</p>
                    <button class="edit-roommate-btn">编辑设定</button>
                </div>
                <div class="roommate-card" data-roommate="2">
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-bed"></i> 室友二</h3>
                    <p class="status" id="roommate2Status">尚未设定</p>
                    <button class="edit-roommate-btn">编辑设定</button>
                </div>
                <div class="roommate-card" data-roommate="3">
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-bed"></i> 室友三</h3>
                    <p class="status" id="roommate3Status">尚未设定</p>
                    <button class="edit-roommate-btn">编辑设定</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="opening-section">
                <h3 class="section-title"><i class="fas fa-scroll"></i> 自定义开场白</h3>
                <div class="form-section">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label><i class="fas fa-pen-fancy"></i> 开场白内容</label>
                        <textarea class="user-input" data-key="openingScene" placeholder="在这里撰写你专属的故事开场...&#10;例如：九月的阳光透过窗帘洒进宿舍，你拖着行李箱推开了305的房门……"></textarea>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tab 2: Function Settings -->
        <div id="tab-panel-2" class="hub-content-panel">
            <h3 class="section-title"><i class="fas fa-toggle-on"></i> 功能开关</h3>
            <div class="form-section">
                <div class="toggle-grid">
                    <div class="toggle-item">
                        <span class="toggle-item-label"><i class="fas fa-book-reader"></i> 总结</span>
                        <label class="toggle-switch"><input type="checkbox" class="function-toggle" data-function="summary" checked><span class="slider"></span></label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="toggle-item">
                        <span class="toggle-item-label"><i class="fas fa-list-ul"></i> 选项</span>
                        <label class="toggle-switch"><input type="checkbox" class="function-toggle" data-function="options"><span class="slider"></span></label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="toggle-item">
                        <span class="toggle-item-label"><i class="fas fa-podcast"></i> 直播</span>
                        <label class="toggle-switch"><input type="checkbox" class="function-toggle" data-function="live"><span class="slider"></span></label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="toggle-item">
                        <span class="toggle-item-label"><i class="fas fa-paint-brush"></i> UI美化</span>
                        <label class="toggle-switch"><input type="checkbox" class="function-toggle" data-function="beautify"><span class="slider"></span></label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="toggle-item">
                        <span class="toggle-item-label"><i class="fas fa-magic"></i> 剧情辅助</span>
                        <label class="toggle-switch"><input type="checkbox" class="function-toggle" data-function="plotAssist"><span class="slider"></span></label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="toggle-item">
                        <span class="toggle-item-label"><i class="fas fa-scroll"></i> 小说模式</span>
                        <label class="toggle-switch"><input type="checkbox" class="function-toggle" data-function="novel"><span class="slider"></span></label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="toggle-item">
                        <span class="toggle-item-label"><i class="fas fa-camera"></i> 画面特写</span>
                        <label class="toggle-switch"><input type="checkbox" class="function-toggle" data-function="closeup"><span class="slider"></span></label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="toggle-item">
                        <span class="toggle-item-label"><i class="fas fa-brain"></i> 逻辑思考</span>
                        <label class="toggle-switch"><input type="checkbox" class="function-toggle" data-function="logic"><span class="slider"></span></label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="toggle-item">
                        <span class="toggle-item-label"><i class="fas fa-ghost"></i> 雌小鬼吐槽</span>
                        <label class="toggle-switch"><input type="checkbox" class="function-toggle" data-function="banter"><span class="slider"></span></label>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3 class="section-title"><i class="fas fa-sliders"></i> 回复设定</h3>
            <div class="form-section">
                <div class="selection-group">
                    <label>📏 回复长度</label>
                    <div class="selection-btn-group" data-group="replyLength">
                        <button class="selection-btn" data-value="简短">简短</button>
                        <button class="selection-btn active" data-value="中等">中等</button>
                        <button class="selection-btn" data-value="冗长">冗长</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="selection-group" style="margin-top: 16px;">
                    <label>👁️ 人称视角</label>
                    <div class="selection-btn-group" data-group="perspective">
                        <button class="selection-btn" data-value="第一人称">第一人称</button>
                        <button class="selection-btn active" data-value="第二人称">第二人称</button>
                        <button class="selection-btn" data-value="第三人称">第三人称</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Real-time Output -->
        <div class="output-section" style="margin: 24px;">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> 实时配置预览</h3>
            <p class="output-label">以下内容将根据你的选择实时更新，可直接复制到游戏中使用：</p>
            <textarea id="realtimeOutput" readonly></textarea>
            <div class="output-buttons">
                <button class="btn btn-primary" id="copyBtn"><i class="fas fa-copy"></i> 一键复制</button>
                <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="clearBtn"><i class="fas fa-eraser"></i> 清空配置</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


</div>

<!-- Character Modal -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="characterModal">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <button class="modal-close"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></button>
        <div class="modal-header">
            <div class="modal-avatar" id="modalAvatar"></div>
            <div class="modal-title">
                <h2 id="modalName"></h2>
                <div class="character-tag" id="modalTag"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-body">
            <div class="modal-section">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-user-circle"></i> 角色设定</h3>
                <div id="modalDescription"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-section">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-eye"></i> 发现秘密后的反应</h3>
